026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mcmodshub.app\"]],[\"qgJHGkUIAEoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICGQoXChFjb20ubWNtb2RzaHViLmFwcBABGAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🧩 50,000+ mods, addons, maps, skins, texture packs \\u0026amp; shaders for Minecraft Bedrock \\u0026amp; MCPE — all in one app, and I add new ones every day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHi, I\\u0026#39;m the developer behind MC Bedrock Mods, and I run it on my own. I built it so finding and installing Minecraft PE content is effortless — no confusing websites, no manual file juggling. Just tap, and it opens in Minecraft. And if something doesn\\u0026#39;t work, I fix it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ 50,000+ MODS AND COUNTING\\u003cbr\\u003eBrowse 50,000+ mods and addons gathered from the biggest public Minecraft Bedrock sources, including CurseForge. I add fresh content daily, so there\\u0026#39;s always something new.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ EVERYTHING YOU\\u0026#39;RE SEARCHING FOR\\u003cbr\\u003e- Addons \\u0026amp; Mods — new mobs, weapons, items, mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003e- Maps — adventure, survival, parkour, city, horror\\u003cbr\\u003e- Texture Packs \\u0026amp; Shaders — HD, realistic, PvP, cartoon\\u003cbr\\u003e- Skins — character skins for Minecraft PE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Scripts \\u0026amp; behavior packs\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 POPULAR THIS MONTH\\u003cbr\\u003eVerity, Actions \\u0026amp; More, Guns 3D, Twixxel\\u0026#39;s Stalkers, Dynamic Light, Villager News, Pokedrock, Bare Bones, Prizma Visuals, FPS Optimizer, Raiyon\\u0026#39;s Java Combat, Tree Chopper, TACZ, Lucky Skyblock, More Body Actions, X-Ray Glow, Glowing Ores, Pickup \\u0026amp; Carry, Modern Furniture, AnimationPlus, RG Shader — and 50,000 more, updated daily.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ ONE-TAP INSTALL\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload any .mcpack, .mcaddon or .mcworld and it opens straight in Minecraft — no file managers, no copying folders. It just works.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ SMART \\u0026amp; FAST\\u003cbr\\u003e- Search in 15+ languages with auto-translation\\u003cbr\\u003e- Sort by Popular, Updated, Most Downloaded\\u003cbr\\u003e- Full description + screenshots for every mod\\u003cbr\\u003e- Save favorites and see your download history\\u003cbr\\u003e- Get notified when new mods drop\\u003cbr\\u003e- Works offline for favorites and history\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💬 SOMETHING BROKEN? I REPLY MYSELF\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a one-person project, not a faceless company. If a mod won\\u0026#39;t download or install, tap \\u0026quot;Report a problem\\u0026quot; — it comes straight to me and I answer you inside the app. 100,000+ players already use it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e❓ FAQ\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow do I install mods on Minecraft Bedrock?\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Find a mod or addon you like\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Tap Download\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Open the downloaded file\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Minecraft Bedrock imports it automatically!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhich Minecraft versions are supported?\\u003cbr\\u003eMods work with current Minecraft Bedrock Edition and Minecraft PE on Android. Each mod page shows its supported versions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDoes it work offline?\\u003cbr\\u003eYes — your favorites and download history work without internet.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhich file formats are supported?\\u003cbr\\u003e.mcpack, .mcaddon and .mcworld — all open directly in Minecraft.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Available in English, Portuguese, Spanish, Russian, Ukrainian and more. Built-in mod-description translation supports 15+ languages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.\\u003cbr\\u003eMinecraft is a trademark of Mojang AB. All mods, addons, maps and skins are fan-made content created and shared by their authors through public sources.\"],\"MCModsHub\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D4Li-Y53pkGRfh6TWASBpFTNius5vOLIsbufUoAjpItlSPhi3qP_XfMhtCmITKzsVAuhYgkZ96GMADtzBbKtCQ\"],null,[23,23,28,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mcmodshub.app\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mcmodshub.app\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $9.99 per item\",[false]],{\"101\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D4Li-Y53pkGRfh6TWASBpFTNius5vOLIsbufUoAjpItlSPhi3qP_XfMhtCmITKzsVAuhYgkZ96GMADtzBbKtCQ\"],null,[23,23,28,255]]]]}]],[[[\"com.fungames.blockcraft\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Nu36aaM2u2mVaItdPaWfHDWp1pi-yExZ_ibd2_ElMmaIuyZ7lB3IxA_p-6tpCTSICDYGQGW9j-Uua20dxBcQEw\"],null,[29,254,234,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8qjEQ9qWSKMT5Lc8k9_SxkE3oUuBmpGJC46BHsn_DwfxHH70HKg0irHK-qRRKKhwAAy