,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fungames.blockcraft\"]],[\"qgJVGlMIAUoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBFwoVCL2E/uvzmeKNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAsgIfCh0KF2NvbS5mdW5nYW1lcy5ibG9ja2NyYWZ0EAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eReady? Block? Go! \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCraft and grow your own village or build freely in an unlimited open world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eFeatures:\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eFun building game:\\u003c/b\\u003e Lots of different constructions. Build a house, a castle, a mine or even a spaceship and the Eiffel Tower!\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eSimulate the best life\\u003c/b\\u003e it\\u0026#39;s a fun simulator game! \\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eLots of pixels:\\u003c/b\\u003e enjoy the special pixel graphics.\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eChoose your character!\\u003cbr\\u003e•  \\u003cb\\u003eAnimals\\u003c/b\\u003e adopt and play with animals! It\\u0026#39;s fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eHighlights:\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAmazing buildings in 3D\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay now one of the best construction games!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLots of Pets and free exploration\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with pets! Adopt a dog, a cat or even an elephant! Unlike other block games, there are no monsters in Block Craft 3D: you can focus on constructing the best buildings or exploring the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMultiplayer game: visit your friends\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart the exploration! You can visit the city built by your friends (or foes) and help them finish their construction. Multiplayer is so much fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCreate and sell\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Block Craft, no need for mods, launchers, or PE. You can create custom blocks, craft special furniture, or complete a blueprint of a building! And even better: sell those and receive lots of gems!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eNot so creative?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Block Craft 3D, no need for maps, just visit the village of your friends to get new ideas and follow the blueprints and guides to easily build fantastic constructions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTry this simulator now and have fun building your city!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBlock Craft 3D: Free Building is brought to you by Fun Games for Free, creator of the 100+ Million downloads games Flight Pilot Simulator, Sniper 3D, and Sniper Shooter.\\u003c/b\\u003e\"],\"Wildlife Studios\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7AWLgvfuYSLy4xHpC_kmolnek9psOVAn-TDefmHQIFP8uvP6UI7sYEFtCW4XoI43XM3GNpAedTgg_BdRGxdf\"],null,[160,235,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,nul