ll,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.roblox.client\"]],[\"qgJHGkUIBUoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICGQoXChFjb20ucm9ibG94LmNsaWVudBABGAM\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"zowmaH7hc5Q\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zowmaH7hc5Q?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:zowmaH7hc5Q\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmoeZKdL-GfUfaIHlnL-cw47M7PJ2lLrPl4OGsEeilyTqVu9PgNZO8dbjAm6SafJK6TkyIrGzCK_gnv4Lkzlh6G4AxEC5aGQvK7HLFHBqEeo1mcJFxrC4M7IjjZLXaxcu9I6A1Laxh_HkG7aEX8WK1tyTIsCQTizZMaIS-Nol4QDp0fnjwg2fAYvHBFz1HgpeTGXKw2_I_XsxBc7hLJOH0kc-kj-JS0vJEJLeQ-Bg_u4MuQqklbcAMtuyS99A0rBnbZ4TzdCHHK9Cl6PoZ0i_ytY29ORI2p-LQLXMnAU593Sw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zowmaH7hc5Q/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"ROBLOX – MILLIONS OF GAMES ACROSS EVERY GENRE. PLAY FREE.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRoblox is home to every kind of game, for every kind of player. Compete in high-octane racing games, battle it out in hardcore tactical shooters, or put your survival skills to the test in unpredictable environments. Embark on an epic adventure in immersive RPGs, build massive empires in tycoons, or dive into horror, anime, and sports games with friends worldwide.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRoblox is constantly evolving, with unique experiences and ambitious, high-fidelity games built by a global community including professional studios, indie teams, and solo creators. There’s always something new to discover every day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart playing some of the most popular games on Roblox today, including Dress to Impress, RIVALS, Steal a Brainrot, Brookhaven RP, Adopt Me! and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHAT YOU CAN DO ON ROBLOX\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY ONLINE MULTIPLAYER GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover deep role-playing games, immersive simulators, action-packed adventures, and more\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore trending experiences and new games daily\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete in massive multiplayer battles, run your own digital business, or embark on epic quests\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE YOUR OWN AVATAR\\u003cbr\\u003e- Customize your avatar with detailed clothing, accessories, and dynamic hairstyles\\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover thousands of user-created 3D avatar items in the Marketplace\\u003cbr\\u003e- Express yourself with unique emotes, and fashion\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCHAT, COMPETE, AND EXPLORE TOGETHER—ANYTIME, ANYWHERE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hang out and play with friends in cross-platform multiplayer games on mobile, tablet, PC, console, and VR headsets\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join a Party and jump into competitive or social experiences together\\u003cbr\\u003e- Age-verified users can communicate in real-time via voice chat or text\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE, PLAY, AND SHARE ON ROBLOX\\u003cbr\\u003e- Design high-fidelity games and virtual spaces using the Roblox Studio engine on Windows or Mac\\u003cbr\\u003e- Publish your experiences and empower yourself as a creator in a massive global community\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dive into immersive 3D multiplayer games and safe, inclusive environments designed for users of all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy endless new content added daily and share your creations with millions of players\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eELEVATE YOUR EXPERIENCE WITH ROBLOX PLUS\\u003cbr\\u003e- Get up to 20% discounts on in-game items, enjoy fee-free Robux transfers, and receive a distinct profile badge\\u003cbr\\u003e- Host free, unlimited private servers for your friends \\u003cbr\\u003e- Publish, trade, and resell your own custom avatar creations on the Marketplace\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eINDUSTRY-LEADING SAFETY, PRIVACY, AND CIVILITY\\u003cbr\\u003e- Advanced content filtering and age-appropriate moderation\\u003cbr\\u003e- Access age-verified spaces and manage your privacy with Roblox Kids and Select Accounts\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clear community guidelines promoting respectful interactions\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dedicated trust \\u0026amp; safety teams working around the clock\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE YOUR OWN GAMES: https://www.roblox.com/develop\\u003cbr\\u003eSUPPORT: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us\\u003cbr\\u003eCONTACT: https://corp.roblox.com/contact/\\u003cbr\\u003ePRIVACY POLICY: https://www.roblox.com/info/privacy\\u003cbr\\u003ePARENT’S GUIDE: https://corp.roblox.com/parents/\\u003cbr\\u003eTERMS OF USE: https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/115004647846\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLEASE NOTE: A network connection is required. Roblox works best over Wi-Fi.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e※ Information on App Permissions: Roblox requires the following permissions for your seamless use of the Roblox app.\\u003cbr\\u003e[Optional Permissions]\\u003cbr\\u003eNotification: For sending notifications (related to the services, experiences, etc.)\\u003cbr\\u003eMicrophone: For in-game voice chat features\\u003cbr\\u003eCamera: For animating your avatar with your movement\\u003cbr\\u003eContacts: For contact importer features (find other users you may know and make recommendations for friends)\\u003cbr\\u003e* You can use the app regardless of whether or not you consent to optional permissions\\u003cbr\\u003e* Certain app features may not work properly if you refuse optional permissions\"],\"Roblox Corporation\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/POelWkaCZ0mSaCrYISBjWACiR_O_qs-A-8EgA9P_nPk59ppnJELjfuCm8wXHcihJ1qKIsKLZrG0cp7oEloIALg\"],null,[5,4,5,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Diverse Content: Discretion Advised\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p