009226],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mmircil.cnb2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mmircil.cnb2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mmircil.cnb2\"]],[\"qgJGGkQIDUoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICGAoWChBjb20ubW1pcmNpbC5jbmIyEAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Do you like building games? Crafting and Building is a new free building game. Download now the FREE game of 2020!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart building and show the world your best game and constructions. Crafting and Building is a free game for the whole family: from kids, boys and girls, to adults.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe gameplay:\\u003cbr\\u003eLearn how to build your house in a castle or in a mine.\\u003cbr\\u003eDecorate your house with your mates \\u0026#39; furniture and your own eyes. Learn more and more, and you will never be able to build massive castles and temples!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExploration:\\u003cbr\\u003eTired of human beings, huh? Play with your dogs, please! Take a dog or a mouse, take a horse! Unlike in other titles, there are no monsters involved in designing and constructing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with your friends:\\u003cbr\\u003eStart exploring! You can visit the world that was built by your friends! Who\\u0026#39;s got the biggest structure? Check if they finished their new castle and give them a hand, they\\u0026#39;ll pay you back later! Multiplayer is really a lot of fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMany block types:\\u003cbr\\u003eThere are many square sorts extending from grass square to precious stone and even sanctuary stone. You have numerous choices with regards to building your realm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCrafting and Building is an innovative free building game where you can play with pets, start an incredible construction and play multiplayer games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Perfect game for the whole family: boys and girls will love it.\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Cool game: Search for a hidden cave with your friends, multiplayer mode is cool!\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Build anything: house with a room and a kitchen? A castle?\\u003cbr\\u003e* - One of the best simulation games: begin constructing your house and meet your neighbors.\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Choose your character: boy or girl? Custom skin ?\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Multiplayer games: you can play online and help your friend to build their house!\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Fun game: Play with villagers and animals it is so fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Cool graphics: enjoy the best pixel graphics with high fps.\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Free game: play the game for free!\\u003cbr\\u003e* - Building game: Build your own constructions. Who will have the best building?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDeveloped by PROTON MOBILE\"],\"GeneRe\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EomYtyZ87mC8mZ_SU03VEk6roesdF4Bw8i7xmb_7Z-bAFmm0S-K4fxUtSSvZ9XRpTnSH4eDi7Jj1pbBUnByKhg\"],null,[154,191,252,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[nu