rcontent.com/HnlKyNxS1E4rSCKP6V_m5w5oroZFsjj4mQi4M0dsaOsCNFSKgaSOTvzIlhRnCu4m7CfoqE95WF3hZEqEQwFmPw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LNrZfXRa52gWUgiRu2zZ56I_j4EsuCHexJ4OO5XgDJXr0ez4ApKuwNkX7XNBm8SMW5_48XkQ-a0Urk7m4nr6G5s\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dygz8KoQ5Doq9Vj3kbgPea8g9ulWJBSONi7euBN6vZm46DRG2WxJp8i0PIZ-Iy8ybLbTuwkKc9ABZulvGxIwBg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o59PVr-tTCBwN97EDBKDuisNfdlE2W23ClU4NM2OWixwmFYE6Hpq8qYcSCnNzckE3SVr9F5ZRRdgoR4vzpQ64A\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HnlKyNxS1E4rSCKP6V_m5w5oroZFsjj4mQi4M0dsaOsCNFSKgaSOTvzIlhRnCu4m7CfoqE95WF3hZEqEQwFmPw\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qcUqhODFkADiXgVxJP7xwfSKHbTDLnDpkTg_jyowVzgykDSaVbclWhM8qrnUjC5qD5ltIXJtjGkTRApgeBsBFQ\"],null,[243,236,7,255]]],\"Mods, maps skins for Minecraft\",[\"4.4\",4.436671],\"Entertainment\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mods.maps.mine\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mods.maps.mine\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mods.maps.mine\"]],[\"qgJIGkYIDkoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICGgoYChJjb20ubW9kcy5tYXBzLm1pbmUQARgD\"],null,[null,\"You need to install Minecraft Pocket Edition for this application. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app installs mods, addons, maps, textures, seeds and skins to game. Everything is totally free for you! One-click installation without any problems. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMods for Minecraft PE and addons.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app collects the most popular, the best and rarest mods and addons: \\u003cbr\\u003e- Furniture mod\\u003cbr\\u003e- Guns mod\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cars mod\\u003cbr\\u003eAlso, mods for vehicles, mobs, lucky blocks, TNT, backpack and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaps for Minecraft and seeds for multiplayer, playing with friends and alone. \\u003cbr\\u003eFamous: prison escape, bedwars, skywars, lucky block race, modern house and sky block. \\u003cbr\\u003eAnd the best maps: buildings, landscape, mini games, parkour, PVP, redstone, survival and others.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTextures and shaders for MCPE which make game more colorful and realistic. Nice shades, lightning and more other. Install realistic shaders and enjoy the game. Different dimensions of packs textures:\\u003cbr\\u003e- 16x16\\u003cbr\\u003e- 32x32\\u003cbr\\u003e- 64x64\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSeeds for Minecraft PE. Lots of unusual seeds are available for you. Lots of popular seeds: village, landscape, island, buildings etc. are here. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSkins for Minecraft (MCPE) contains the best, rarest and the most popular skins. Please, be sure that you will find skin for yourself:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Girls skins\\u003cbr\\u003e- Boys skins\\u003cbr\\u003e- Youtubers skins\\u003cbr\\u003eMoreover, skins of monsters, characters, superheroes, heroes, from games, animals, military, robots, camouflage, anime etc. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDISCLAIMER: \\u003cbr\\u003eNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT APP. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT. Name Minecraft, trademark Minecraft and Minecraft Assets are property of Mojang AB or its dear owner. All rights are reserved in accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe do not claim copyright or intellectual property. If you find a violation, please contact us by mail: aloeteams@gmail.com\"],\"ALOE\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qcUqhODFkADiXgVxJP7xwfSKHbTDLnDpkTg_jyowVzgykDSaVbclWhM8qrnUjC5qD5ltIXJt