]]],\"Minecraft Building Guide-NOOBO\",[\"4.3\",4.33],\"Books \\u0026 Reference\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.icystudios.noobo\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.icystudios.noobo\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.icystudios.noobo\"]],[\"qgJKGkgIEEoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICHAoaChRjb20uaWN5c3R1ZGlvcy5ub29ibxABGAM\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dBdNLtINVMEg\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BdNLtINVMEg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"NOOBO turns any Minecraft build into clear, LEGO style instructions shown in true 3D, so you can build houses, castles, and bases block by block with zero guesswork.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW NOOBO WORKS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePick any build from a library of 150+ houses, castles, farms, and more\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen it in true 3D and spin it around to see it from every angle\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow the step by step guide, placing blocks one layer at a time\\u003cbr\\u003eUse the exact material list so you always gather the right blocks\\u003cbr\\u003eUse block inspection tool, measurement tool for exact block inspection, different layer view directions and styles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSEE IT FROM EVERY ANGLE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFlat tutorials hide the one thing that matters most: depth. You can\\u0026#39;t tell what sits in front, what\\u0026#39;s behind, or how the layers stack, so you build it, step back, and it\\u0026#39;s wrong. NOOBO\\u0026#39;s interactive 3D guides let you orbit the whole structure, look inside, and check every layer as you go. It is like having LEGO instructions for Minecraft, except you can walk all the way around them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEVERY BUILD COMES FULLY LOADED\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen any build and you get:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA rotatable 3D model you can spin and zoom, like a live blueprint\\u003cbr\\u003eClear step by step stages, one layer at a time\\u003cbr\\u003eAn exact material list with precise block counts\\u003cbr\\u003eReal measurements and dimensions\\u003cbr\\u003eMove at your own pace and finish with something you are genuinely proud of.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e150+ BUILDS, WITH MORE EVERY WEEK\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNever run out of Minecraft build ideas again. Your library never stops growing, with fresh, hand crafted builds added every single week, including free ones, across every theme, style, and size:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHouses and bases: survival houses, starter houses, modern houses, wooden houses, cottages, farmhouses, treehouses, beach houses, lake houses, mountain bases, underground bunkers\\u003cbr\\u003eCastles and medieval: castles, fortresses, towers, keeps, cathedrals, dungeons, palaces, blacksmiths, taverns, medieval villages\\u003cbr\\u003eModern and luxury: modern mansions, glass villas, skyscrapers, penthouses, hotels, city houses, apartments, pool houses\\u003cbr\\u003eFantasy worlds: wizard towers, dragon lairs, sky islands, floating castles, ancient ruins, enchanted forests, magic libraries\\u003cbr\\u003eJapanese and Asian: pagodas, shrines, temples, zen gardens, tea houses, torii gates\\u003cbr\\u003eFarms and redstone: auto farms, crop farms, animal farms, XP farms, iron farms, secret doors, hidden bases, storage rooms, working machines\\u003cbr\\u003eCities and big builds: bridges, fountains, parks, train stations, stadiums, lighthouses, windmills, statues\\u003cbr\\u003eThemed and seasonal: pirate ships, spaceships, Halloween builds, winter lodges, holiday builds, amusement parks\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGREAT FOR EVERY PLAYER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you are brand new to building or a seasoned pro chasing your next mega build, NOOBO has easy builds, cool builds, and epic builds for every skill level and every world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGET YOUR BUILD ROASTED\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink your build is a masterpiece? Let our fun AI roast tool be the judge. Show it your creation and get a brutally funny review, share the burns with your friends, then come back and prove it wrong. It is the most fun way to find out if your mega base is actually fire.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILT FOR THE WAY YOU PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWorks with Minecraft Bedrock, Java, and Pocket Edition (MCPE / PE), on phone and tablet, alongside any shaders, mods, addons, and texture packs you already use.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNO ADS, JUST BUILDING\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo banners, no pop ups, no interruptions. NOOBO is clean and ad free, so nothing gets between you and your next build. We also do not track you, so your data stays yours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload NOOBO and start your next Minecraft build in 3D today.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.noobo.app/terms-of-service\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.noobo.app/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNOOBO is an independent app and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or associated with Mojang AB or Microsoft. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang AB. NOOBO provides building guides for entertainment and educational purposes only.\"],\"Icy Studios\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UR49O2x_JKTbSlcHb503Rbx9r7rfRyXjDlavQ1u26ckHVHwJEy6p6x9w9vtL1r0Nr2Jpt2-4LcPQqGwMSntJ\"],null,[122,83,255,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LP