,null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.crone.skineditorforminecraftpe\"]],[\"qgJYGlYIEkoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICKgooCiJjb20uY3JvbmUuc2tpbmVkaXRvcmZvcm1pbmVjcmFmdHBlEAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"We present the 3D Skin Editor for Minecraft\\u003cbr\\u003eSkin Editor is work with original Minecraft skins with a base resolution of 64x64 pixels.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis editor has an RGB color palette with the ability to save a separate palette and sort colors.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStandard kits:\\u003cbr\\u003e-pipette\\u003cbr\\u003e-bucket\\u003cbr\\u003e-brush\\u003cbr\\u003e-eraser\\u003cbr\\u003e-gradient (you can draw with colors from the palette)\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eMany mods support transparency of skins. The palette has an alpha channel (transparency).\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eEditing occurs by body parts, with the ability to select them. For convenience, arms or legs can be edited in mirror mode.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo see the full edited skin open the right side where you can set the background color, and set walk mode of the skin.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eIf you accidentally make a mistake and click on the wrong pixel, then the system of returning to the previous action will help you.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eYou can also change the editing background in the settings on the main screen or change the editing orientation, for example, from horizontal to vertical or disable the joystick so you can rotate part of the skin with your fingers.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eThe application has a Skins Collection section, which contains skins from the World of Skins application, more than 200,000 skins on any topic with the ability to search. Once you find the skin there, you can edit it.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eThere is also a My Skins section, it contains your saved skins from the editor, where you can view them in more detail, change the type Alex or Steve abd install them in the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eThe application has autosave, it automatically saves your skin so that your editing progress is not lost. If you accidentally close the application, your progress will also be saved, but without the color picker\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn addition the editor supports two layers of skins which allows you to add the details of the relief of your skin.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eDISCLAIMER:\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.minecraft.net/en-us/usage-guidelines\"],\"Crone\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1HzAwhUiPiuhoQyPE7ZjPOA5P_xLpvl8K1gjfvG-heIGCH9gi0-TRyv1-hYuArYRXLT1igH6bTkyqy1uAcNMvA\"],null,[89,116,144,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/app