gle.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.craftgames.worldcrft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.craftgames.worldcrft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.craftgames.worldcrft\"]],[\"qgJWGlQIFkoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBFwoVCITqmt7oyYqNQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAsgIgCh4KGGNvbS5jcmFmdGdhbWVzLndvcmxkY3JmdBABGAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003e★Welcome to WorldCraft. This is Mine, Survival, Block Craft Game Online★\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eStart multi crafting and building of your mini world 3D and share it to multiplayer. Join exciting exploration games.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFeatures:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eCREATIVE ONLINE MULTI PLAYER\\u003c/b\\u003e: build \\u0026amp; chat\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Thousands of \\u003cb\\u003eMINI WORLD\\u003c/b\\u003e for lite exploration\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eOPEN WORLD SURVIVAL\\u003c/b\\u003e: mine resources, fight mobs\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Totally for free\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eCRAFTING AND BUILDING\\u003c/b\\u003e recipes for food, blocks, items, armor etc.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Differerent animals\\u003cbr\\u003e★ \\u003cb\\u003eADOPT PETS\\u003c/b\\u003e like wolf, ocelot\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Ride horse\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Wide variety of weapon: bow, tnt, snowballs\\u003cbr\\u003e★ 300+ \\u003cb\\u003eCUSTOM SKINS\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ 10+ predefined maps to start crafting and building\\u003cbr\\u003e★ 3D HD graphics, 4+ block texture packs, cute sounds\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGame modes:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e►\\u003cb\\u003eCREATIVE ONLINE MULTIPLAYER\\u003c/b\\u003e: Build a dream mini world 3D alone or with many other real friends. Upload the map from single player to online. Protect your map with a password to play only with friends or upload it as a read-only, so others will not edit your mini world. Here you can find thousands of maps created by others. Find cool ideas to create fantastic cube creations like city, village etc. Create and share with no limit for creativity!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e►\\u003cb\\u003eSURVIVAL OPEN WORLD SINGLE PLAYER:\\u003c/b\\u003e Start with cube world exploration, mine resources, block craft items, build a shelter to hide at nights from monsters. Improve your skills by using different recipes. Interact with friendly mobs, grow plants, make exciting farm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e►\\u003cb\\u003eCREATIVE SINGLE PLAYER:\\u003c/b\\u003e Develop your creative skills alone. Here you will find 10+ predefined maps to start building my mini world. Create anything according your imagination.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a free crafting and building, exploration survival craft, mine without limits for multi creative or kraft needs. Customize your character using 300+ skins grouped by theme. Meet friends all around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGames Highlights:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Amazing 3D creations\\u003cbr\\u003e* Fun Lite Exploration\\u003cbr\\u003e* Friendly Atmosphere\\u003cbr\\u003e* Block craft \\u0026amp; chat in real time\\u003cbr\\u003e* Lots of animals\\u003cbr\\u003e* Attacking hostile mobs\\u003cbr\\u003e* Different weapon\\u003cbr\\u003e* FREE \\u0026amp; EASY \\u0026amp; FUN\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eJOIN NOW exploration crafting and building games with survival for free 3D. Mine and block craft, create unforgettable happy moments together in the best online multi player.\\u003c/b\\u003e\"],\"Playlabs LLC\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GUW51plVtkY_c6430yxIsA0HJcJVMyqHHsJDMomm5Lx1OOqGpqZo7xPNa3hnyd0CynbuY2gWkfKNU5rKUH0_GMw\"],null,[192,231,240,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com