with voice and text chat, even if they\\u0026#39;re on console or PC.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Install games remotely on your console from your phone.\\u003cbr\\u003e- See game invite notifications, achievements from you and your friends, messages, and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore Game Pass and get customized recommendations, notifications about new games, queue games to play, and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Buy games you want without leaving the app.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Track, claim, and redeem your Rewards points.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The XBOX mobile app is the best way to stay connected to your world of gaming.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eXBOX APP AGREEMENT\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe following terms supplement any software license terms that accompany the XBOX App.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease refer to Microsoft\\u0026#39;s EULA for Terms of Service for Microsoft\\u0026#39;s gaming applications on Android. By installing the app, you agree to these terms and conditions: https://support.xbox.com/help/subscriptions-billing/manage-subscriptions/microsoft-software-license-terms-mobile-gaming\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEEDBACK\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you give feedback about the XBOX App to Microsoft, you give to Microsoft, without charge, the right to use, share and commercialize your feedback in any way and for any purpose. You also give to third parties, without charge, any patent rights needed for their products, technologies and services to use or interface with any specific parts of a Microsoft software or service that includes the feedback. You will not give feedback that is subject to a license that requires Microsoft to license its software or documentation to third parties because we include your feedback in them. These rights survive this agreement.\"],\"Microsoft Corporation\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UdSIboAXsRC1O017eDJJFb52UvRiCyjgs80wG4KePXAXQafW0h