VsPc_YYhoQ8OxJver5g2wc24q3dMg1TUE9lXp6EHVau6eyX6P-A2EK7i429M9i-bs64EOGKaMEeF3Zukw\"]],[null,2,[2856,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Pjj0q2GviVKRYtiivauYaumVOWzTdclOamPpP6E2NjT18a8pqv4wpBIWv43kk6YtEIRB2tsaqVATsH1UTVGww8g\"]],[null,2,[2856,1280],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jvG9Tihb52X_bkouO0pEkZejYyI_G8BCMvQ9V-tGuxy5Z8lFzUc9ey-KLyYRcK9UA-RkrOZpE_v44voYe3qF-g\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UYYl8y2i3dQ0EIyW_ftaXxUYRV-q2IxsZUAZHtuIZXk9KaX0omzpfxyLUC1r4-9Xn2zK6CqrPzRV_lxqBIBJEg\"],null,[19,14,6,255]]],\"Verity Mod for Minecraft PE\",[\"4.5\",4.4965515],\"Tools\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.l13devstudio.verit\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.l13devstudio.verit\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.l13devstudio.verit\"]],[\"qgJMGkoIIEoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICHgocChZjb20ubDEzZGV2c3R1ZGlvLnZlcml0EAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"The Verity mod adds one of the strangest and most terrifying characters to Minecraft PE—a huge yellow sphere with a frozen, creepy toothy smile. This mystical creature suddenly appears among the trees or in open areas and begins to relentlessly follow the player. Its presence completely shatters the usual atmosphere of a peaceful game, turning your survival into a constant attempt to hide from this pursuing, eerie face.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe yellow smiley moves silently, floating above the ground, and can catch you off guard at the most unexpected moment. You will have to constantly look back and find ways to protect your shelter from this intrusive nightmare. Test whether you can hold out in a world where your every step is watched by a huge smiling entity, ready to destroy any sense of safety.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDisclaimer:\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated with Mojang AB in any way. The Minecraft name, the Minecraft trademark and the Minecraft assets are the property of Mojang AB or their respective owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.minecraft.net/en-us/usage-guidelines\"],\"I13\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UYYl8y2i3dQ0EIyW_ftaXxUYRV-q2IxsZUAZHtuIZXk9KaX0omzpfxyLUC1r4-9Xn2zK6CqrPzRV_lxqBIBJEg\"],null,[19,14,6,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.l13devstudio.verit\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.l13devstudio.verit\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],{\"102\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UYYl8y2i3dQ0EIyW_ftaXxUYRV-q2IxsZUAZHtuIZXk9KaX0omzpfxyLUC1r4-9Xn2zK6CqrPzRV_lxqBIBJEg\"],null,[19,14,6,255]]]]}]],[[[\"