PWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICIAoeChhtYXR0ZWNhcnJhLmNoYXRjcmFmdC5wcm8QARgD\"],null,[null,\"ChatCraft for Minecraft allows you to connect to every Vanilla, Forge, Bukkit, Spigot and Sponge server!\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app supports Minecraft 1.5.2 to 1.21.8!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tConnect to any Minecraft server from version 1.7.2 to 1.21.8!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tFull support for chat colors\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tMini-map and gravity\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tMove your player\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tInventory: click on the items to teleport across the server!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tChat logs: you will find chats of your sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tThe best AFK experience: automatically reconnect, recurrent movements/messages/commands\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tCustomisable notifications when being attacked or when you receive a particular message\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tSupports Forge servers\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tPlayer list with skins\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tSupports multiple accounts: you can use different usernames to login in different servers\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tAuto teleport to spawn after login\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tAuto login or register: ChatCraft can remember the password you use on non-premium servers so you can login even faster!\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\tTab complete and Message history: you can navigate through messages that you already sent\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEmail: carrara.dev@gmail.com\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin our Telegram group for additional support and news: https://t.me/joinchat/SWllmy4ju8qb_8Ii\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFAQ:\\u003cbr\\u003eQ: Why isn\\u0026#39;t there my language?\\u003cbr\\u003eA: Help us translating ChatCraft in your language! Contact me on carrara.dev@gmail.com or on Telegram!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQ: The app disconnects when I leave it in background!\\u003cbr\\u003eA: Check out this guide: https://www.chatcraft.app/afk-support/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eQ: What is included in ChatCraft Pro?\\u003cbr\\u003eA: I constantly add new features, so this list might miss some of them:\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tMake small movements and see your character move in the mini-map\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tReceive notifications when a particular word is received\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tOption to move automatically every two minutes\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tOption to automatically reconnect when disconnected\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tNavigate through sent messages\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tOption to enable chat logs \\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tUnlimited number of servers and accounts\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tAccess and click your inventory\\u003cbr\\u003e  •\\tYou won\\u0026#39;t see ads and you will be able to remove sponsored servers and disable \\u0026quot;I join using ChatCraft\\u0026quot; message.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDisclaimers:\\u003cbr\\u003eNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT.\\u003cbr\\u003eWe are not affiliated or associated with Mojang.\"],\"Carrara\",\"5,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W9GrdXFkGiG6zQo7anG3qKD0Z2iBLNwWzwxlppeFkMDlBvM-mWUhZNIFr7LdNplFG3mikt4oOpYUppZP-FM18O0\"],null,[91,53,50,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[3990000,\"USD\",\"$3.99\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,2,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmattecarra.chatcraft.pro\\u0026rdid\\u003dmattecarra.chatcraft.pr