ouse.best.building.craft.vip\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.diamond.city.house.best.building.craft.vip\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.diamond.city.house.best.building.craft.vip\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIJEoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICNgo0Ci5jb20uZGlhbW9uZC5jaXR5LmhvdXNlLmJlc3QuYnVpbGRpbmcuY3JhZnQudmlwEAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Block World - Craft City – Unleash your imagination and build the ultimate block world!\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter an open-world sandbox where you can craft, build, and explore endless adventures. Design epic structures, create your dream city, and discover vast biomes in a fully customizable 3D environment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠️ Build \\u0026amp; Create Anything\\u003cbr\\u003eConstruct houses, castles, farms, skyscrapers, and entire cities with limitless blocks.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Massive Open World\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore forests, mountains, rivers, and hidden areas while gathering resources.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔨 Craft \\u0026amp; Mine Resources\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect wood, stone, ores, and more to craft tools, decorations, and building blocks.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Immersive Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth controls and realistic building simulation for players of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Customize Your World\\u003cbr\\u003eShape terrains, add decorations, and design your city exactly how you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👾 Survival \\u0026amp; Creative Modes\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay in Survival Mode to gather, mine, and fight—or switch to Creative Mode for unlimited building freedom.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Multiplayer Fun\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with friends, build together, and share your creations online.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Play Block World - Craft City?\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 Endless Creativity: Bring your ideas to life without limits.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Fun for Everyone: Easy to play, perfect for kids and adults alike.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Infinite Adventures: Explore, survive, and craft your dream city in one massive world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download Block World - Craft City now and start building your perfect world today!\"],\"Patane Global\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lQPA076QqBZgNgcupcLdGtIEv12bWV3GQj5eBtgXBxBAWQreWdhxHm6CR0mKbTrJoel9Yg3D2EdT1Q5BY7BG\"],null,[77,83,83,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.diamond.city.house.best.building.craft.vip\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.diamond.city.house.best.building.craft.vip\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],{\"101\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lQPA076QqBZgNgcupcLdGtIEv12bWV3GQj5eBtgXBxBAWQreWdhxHm6CR0mKbTrJoel9Yg3D2EdT1Q5BY7BG\"],null,[77,83,83,255]]]]}]],[[[\"com.multicraft.game