s/details?id\\u003dcom.multicraft.game\"]],[\"qgJJGkcIJUoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICGwoZChNjb20ubXVsdGljcmFmdC5nYW1lEAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#14AC48\\\"\\u003eIntroducing MultiCraft ― a world of unlimited opportunities! Get ready for real Adventures!\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild and Destroy Blocks. Get Resources and Create Various Tools, Blocks and Weapons with which you can Survive and create unique Buildings.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eChoose your side in this world ― a Builder \\u003cb\\u003e(Creative mode)\\u003c/b\\u003e or a Ruthless Hunter, who will do everything to stay alive \\u003cb\\u003e(Survival mode)\\u003c/b\\u003e!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e► Be careful, in this world not only peaceful Animals, but an awful Monsters too! Win a battle with them and you will get priceless resources!\\u003cbr\\u003e► Swim across the seas for new lands and resources ― lands are unlimited. Exploration them!\\u003cbr\\u003e► If you decided to Survive ― keep eye on hunger and fill out it in time! Search for food, grow plants and kill mobs for meat!\\u003cbr\\u003e► Built your shelter from the monsters and you will survive this night! They are coming for you… Zombies, Skeletons, Huge Spiders and other hostile mobs.\\u003cbr\\u003e► At any time you can fly to the skies with the “fly” mode or become fast as flash with the “fast” mode. Make the game easier if you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eIn this game, your actions are limited only by your imagination! The game does not require any skills ― you can understand everything in the first minutes of the game. With our game you can spend good time anywhere and anytime! And it\\u0026#39;s completely FREE!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eDo you want to play with your friends? Join one of the user servers (“Multiplayer” or “Host Server” tabs). The game has a constantly updated list of different servers. You are sure to find one you like.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eIn our game you will find:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e► Cows, pigs, colorful sheep and other peaceful mobs;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Huge and Small Spiders;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Insidious Skeletons;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Strong Zombies and other hostile mobs;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Red and Blue ore, mechanisms;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Realistic gameplay;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Chickens, that lay eggs;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Stable FPS and long-distance map and world drawing without lags;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Highly optimized game and world generation for all modern devices;\\u003cbr\\u003e► A lot of different biomes and the unique topography;\\u003cbr\\u003e► A large number of different foods and plants;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Convenient and fully adapted touch controls;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Accelerated flight;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Single-player game with Survival and Creative modes;\\u003cbr\\u003e► Multiplayer mode on multiple servers.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eMultiCraft® is a registered trademark in the United States, UK, and other countries.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAn open source application released under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.\\u003cbr\\u003eSource code and license agreement are available at: https://github.com/MultiCraft\\u003cbr\\u003e© 2014-2025 All rights reserved.\"],\"MultiCraft\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0QqHw4CrkY0WiwnyVEqrS_YyajffWZUqxVTIvF1kAvYWFydpQYxqewmABQ-l3VVZGNa7Ond3e1ajorA9S0qpxQ\"],null,[2,168,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[nul