 application that contains thousands of skins for Minecraft in its large collection. 26 themed sets are waiting for you, and the collection of skins is constantly being updated. The skins for Minecraft in the collection are distributed by thematic groups: superheroes, youtubers, camouflage, hacker skin, military, hirobrins and skins from cult games and many others.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe application has a skin editor that will allow you to edit any model, you can download your own skin from the device for editing. The skin editor will help you edit each pixel of the model using the following tools: pencil, eyedropper, fill, eraser and a multi-thousand palette.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn the Wardrobe of Minecraft 3D, you can create a skin from a variety of ready-made elements. Mix elements and create a unique skin. The convenient functionality that contains the minecraft wardrobe allows you to cancel and return the last actions, save intermediate results and reset everything if it didn\\u0026#39;t work out this time. Coloring the elements will create an original skin style for Minecraft.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnother super feature is the creation of a paper model of the skin, which you can print and glue. Share the paper model with your friends. Get a skin model toy and play real Minecraft with your friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe application supports both new formats of skins with a size of 64x64 and old versions with a size of 32x64. It is possible to edit the lower and upper layers separately. You can embed the skin in the game according to the instructions that you will find in the application in the \\u0026quot;Information\\u0026quot; section.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFunctional features of the application:\\u003cbr\\u003e- skin editor;\\u003cbr\\u003e- paper model;\\u003cbr\\u003e- a wardrobe with a lot of ready-made elements;\\u003cbr\\u003e- 3D viewing mode;\\u003cbr\\u003e- gallery of backgrounds;\\u003cbr\\u003e- adding your own background to the skin;\\u003cbr\\u003e- create your own gallery of skins inside the app;\\u003cbr\\u003e- save to your device;\\u003cbr\\u003e- ability to share the model;\\u003cbr\\u003e- support for the old and new versions of the skin and embedding it in the game;\\u003cbr\\u003e- constant updating of sets;\\u003cbr\\u003e- support for app users.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Pro version is available in the application for unlimited access to all sets of skins, adding your own background and no ads. Upgrade to the premium version and enjoy unlimited functionality, and we, in turn, will organize personal support and early access to all new sets of skins for Minecraft.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSkins Pack will open you an amazing world of skins for the game Minecraft. Download the app and surprise your friends with your new crafting hero. If you have any suggestions for improving our application, then feel free to write to us by email. We are always glad to receive your feedback!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines\"],\"Android Tools (ru)\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0F7fWWczWfnZjqplbyDFcfvHJiFHWX37m-ix0l1xhy30_nU2t-IJpFfwAY5AlxnX9WDJlZ7goZaEfl3BPSFH_g\"],null,[204,204,202,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-App Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u