3,1400],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EZcXzpB8he06roY5ySb9vkRXfHxb4NyHPGVKD0diz9WLqfv9xT9cE0uR66vfNrf1kJtrosTWy-_7DKHfEQVx4VU\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t-c0jKNNCWlpu7JIKcielEjQ0Q06abPv3ZpT6DIgagC3q-kUUR_R2W32-TUWE2UWjy9MhEjDUnYwv78aEnOa\"],null,[63,5,92,255]]],\"Master For Minecraft - Mods\",[\"4.4\",4.4144144],\"Entertainment\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmcpemaster.minecraftmaps.minecraftmods\\u0026rdid\\u003dmcpemaster.minecraftmaps.minecraftmods\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmcpemaster.minecraftmaps.minecraftmods\"]],[\"qgJcGloIJ0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICLgosCiZtY3BlbWFzdGVyLm1pbmVjcmFmdG1hcHMubWluZWNyYWZ0bW9kcxABGAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"This application requires Minecraft Pocket Edition\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster for Minecraft - Launcher is an app to manage everything related to your Minecraft game.\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster for Minecraft Launcher is a powerful utility for Minecraft PE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith the help of this program you\\u0026#39;ll have access to hundreds of skins, maps, and mods, all ready to be downloaded and used in one click. This program is \\u0026quot;must have\\u0026quot; helper for any player who plays Minecraft.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMCPE Master for Minecraft- Launcher is a great way to get the most out of Minecraft - Pocket Edition. Launcher supports the latest versions of MCPE. Combining the advantages of an editor and a launcher, it will allow you to bring all your ideas to life in MCPE.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMCPE Launcher Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e-Ability to download mods, maps, textures, skins directly from the launcher.\\u003cbr\\u003e-Light weight and great functionality.\\u003cbr\\u003e-Simple and convenient interface.\\u003cbr\\u003e-Support new versions of minecraft.\\u003cbr\\u003e-3000+ Resources for Minecraft.\\u003cbr\\u003e-Detailed description and screenshots.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster for Minecraft - Launcher is very simple to use thanks to its user-friendly interface. You\\u0026#39;ll see a variety of tabs inside: minecraft maps, skins, textures,mcpe mods, and etc. Within each section, you\\u0026#39;ll see a full list of all the available resources, each with its own description and screenshots.All these functions are available with one click install!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*** MCPE Master is a revolutionary launcher for Minecraft Pocket Edition, which can do almost everything. ***\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDISCLAIMER: This is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Name,  Brand and Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner.  In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAll files provided for download in this application are provided under the terms of a free distribution license.\"],\"Stoke Apps\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t-c0jKNNCWlpu7JIKcielEjQ0Q06abPv3ZpT6DIgagC3q-kUUR_R2W32-TUWE2UWjy9MhEjDUnYwv78aEnOa\"],null,[63,5,92,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[nul