.com/3TXgBytjQTnASgkyggYgwX5cMGOplX8wzI1MZH5k5KUqXbz9saAsLZWngo6NEGRTcLZ9RXlcnBok52r6NW53\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tRYxUQhDdh86yRaEUIY5FICsOSAurLnFz6e8l2yqDMwU43qsT81iinvwa0_T47bvf1Ge9wng7WW1KvRZX-JgzA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dbU0TKZJX2Qn4E506x2aYHdyr_6Cw85thQmZIKIPpYT0H3BZgVFaU3YRIa75IqBFQL7RgfuttvGF_8j8J4n0cto\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5YHacOZyCgIibGRKXDdvRSzoeJThZJMdPPc1j3iCGl2oDJWQU3GKrnA9W4yL3bGqA7AMb2_oVksTVk3dI1nL\"],null,[150,213,126,255]]],\"Block Craft 3D: Planet Craft\",[\"4.1\",4.122314],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.craftgames.plntcrft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.craftgames.plntcrft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.craftgames.plntcrft\"]],[\"qgJNGksIK0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICHwodChdjb20uY3JhZnRnYW1lcy5wbG50Y3JmdBABGAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Block Craft 3D: Planet Craft is an online block-building and mini craft survival game where you can build, create, mine \\u0026amp; craft worlds with friends. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJump into an endless block world full of adventure, creativity, and multiplayer fun — perfect for fans of building and crafting games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSurvival and Exploration\\u003cbr\\u003eTest your skills in Survival Mode. Gather resources, mine blocks, and build shelters to stay alive in a living planet crafter universe. Fight wild mobs, gear up, and explore unknown lands. Every sunrise brings new challenges and discoveries.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreative Building\\u003cbr\\u003eLove designing? Then Creative Mode is your playground. Use unlimited blocks to build, design, and decorate everything from cozy homes to futuristic cities. Express yourself in this immersive building and creation world where imagination has no limits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiplayer World\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin thousands of players online in a shared multicraft adventure. Explore other players’ lands, visit creative builds, and team up for epic projects. Worldcraft fans will love the freedom to create, connect, and explore in real time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClans, Trade, and Teleports\\u003cbr\\u003eForm clans, trade valuable items, and teleport instantly across huge lands. Whether you enjoy my craft or primal-style gameplay, Planet Craft gives you the power to build, explore, and cooperate with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePets and Companions \\u003cbr\\u003eTame horses, cats, and dogs to accompany you on your mini block 3D journeys. These loyal friends help you survive, explore, and collect rare items on your adventures.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivate Worlds and Custom Rules \\u003cbr\\u003eCreate your own private servers and set custom rules. Build peaceful, creative zones or test your skills in extreme survival challenges. Your world, your way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMini Games and Quests \\u003cbr\\u003eExpand your fun with mini games like TNT Run, Spleef, Mincraft, Hide and Seek, and Hunger Games. Complete daily quests, earn rewards, and unlock rare block and skin.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Players Love Planet Craft \\u003cbr\\u003e• Massive open world with infinite biomes and adventures\\u003cbr\\u003e• Real-time multiplayer with chat and friends\\u003cbr\\u003e• Powerful building tools and crafting system\\u003cbr\\u003e• Daily bonuses, free coins, and custom skins\\u003cbr\\u003e• Optimized 3D graphics for all Android devices\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGreat for fans of sandbox games inspired by Multicraft, Survival craft, and Worldcraft adventures. Experience creative building, open-world survival, and endless exploration in Planet Craft.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBlock Craft 3D: Planet Craft brings together everything players love from block craft, mini craft, and world craft games — all in one place. Whether you build, mine, or explore, this is the ultimate sandbox experience. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your dream world and start your adventure today!\"],\"Playlabs LLC\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5YHacOZyCgIibGRKXDdvRSzoeJThZJMdPPc1j3iCGl2oDJWQU3GKrnA9W4yL3bGqA7AMb2_oVksTVk3dI1nL\"],null,[150,213,126,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.craftgames.plntcrft\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.craftgames.plntcrft\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]],{\"101\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5YHacOZyCgIibGRKXDdvRSzoeJThZJMdPPc1j3iCGl2oDJWQU3GKrnA9W4yL3bGqA7AMb2_oVksTVk3dI1nL\"],null,[150,213,126,255]]]]}]],[[[\"com.artech.shaders\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.co