eusercontent.com/rT-AljSGeGnabHtTlcnB7078IGB6-ispHiU3NJIH3cHUjpv0iTZqshaVjT9-Q5pKHlgeYhsScFGGOF5M-L4J\"],null,[173,211,254,255]]],\"World Block Mini Craft 3D\",[\"4.2\",4.16],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.barkahmaps.brawlstars\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.barkahmaps.brawlstars\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.barkahmaps.brawlstars\"]],[\"qgJPGk0ILUoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICIQofChljb20uYmFya2FobWFwcy5icmF3bHN0YXJzEAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"9DcfaB_b15U\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9DcfaB_b15U?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:9DcfaB_b15U\",null,[1024,576],null,null,\"AXH1ezloiT0JlPGcO_lFC2Dm0MGMVmvW9NTGpHCL7g5_tguSEeGMhEx8Ql5f66-kE2Gc7wYFMkjRf8p5cZ2OJ35vI1a5sxlnHFu3kFR7eqskUGyZDn8NxX0lhx200IC6_n4e3GnmO6dn28lVZyyfkKOKf6_ozZ1-UqNYokNGRPJt1i_CVW63PXyagaKaC9pcr_1xY4mZn9vYOPLlmGcAGUGYKEkP3krx-INwhbc980fUQ-4yWmJmPPFYNc5HqzQ9q5N58SogUKJLlzeNyeNTmhFguabopApB_7dIn3GN4n3syJnsag\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9DcfaB_b15U/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"World Block Mini craft 3D - A Free Crafting Game of 2025\\u003cbr\\u003eWorld Block Mini craft 3D is a free crafting game of 2025 that offers an open-world sandbox experience to players. This game is compatible with Android 9.0, and falls under the category of arcade games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game generates the world in real-time, giving players a feeling of total freedom to craft and build their own survival world. The game is designed for both boys and girls, and players can explore territories, gather and use resources for the development of their possessions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this game, players are put in a modern town with modern houses, airports, highways, and gardens. Each house has a garden where players can plant different types of vegetation. There are also various animals, such as lions, tigers, zebras, rhinos, and more. The game also features a standalone mode where players can quickly climb and dive and fly anywhere they want.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOverall, World Block Mini craft 3D is an enjoyable game that offers a great sandbox experience for players who love building games.\"],\"YAS Media\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rT-AljSGeGnabHtTlcnB7078IGB6-ispHiU3NJIH3cHUjpv0iTZqshaVjT9-Q5pKHlgeYhsScFGGOF5M-L4J\"],null,[173,211,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.barkahmaps.brawlstars\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.barkahmaps.brawlstars\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],{\"101\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rT-AljSGeGnab