om/ngHYXcTqoJ6PqA-axOQwwDeM2GgOfnxt-HPxZOv81J6VEck_n8zMKhkQz-eQCh5m5thhJiz4mUQr1LbkH7NJWw\"]],[null,2,[1600,720],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/la4TPNT0KaJCoqAij4fsOcIO7GA19Wj8F9eJ212-mU0fGYMjk3cQiKLsPJaYCHzcbiROGRxRQnjPg2fqAKi4\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jEM6ieec2Ira_qdrwGMq73KDypgqVkwdOF7KrUNcIpAL6kjcvSQEVzCNskg3LwJIHI-skZnHaCqPcI0fld_M6Q\"]],[null,2,[2400,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2TwXp39pfa4J_OV_7r5ci9KkS26WgnJN8VGTwNreScIZISwc_hDfT-cflYeKr-QotFeodIRrzxNle-lY5XEe\"]],[null,2,[2400,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ehmwwgi-WPVqjtxMnUHX5_txGpHLrN-71L-YYvCxiN3R-IrWtfKtwlY4DiQZ8VeHYnJXqZDthdL8xczcx8PrlA\"]],[null,2,[2400,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JOTiqf0enJ7PkoWPZ9h4Re6aCOzWuAIgwnpw4N3-ukxFVsXmSwPQ0SVU096p1_jpIyKaq8H7QQ_ynnE_QnNu\"]],[null,2,[2400,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KJTvd01MPCYm59VMqguU90f_iovbktJkuGem0EKInc7Geh-wCoUG1rSkRChxeZ4MqSmEPiwtTvN8f-9Chv-ZhQ\"]],[null,2,[2400,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G4Gm_ou7XRB2H-aecJQL5zQ22Mg4t8HskZoCESGdWrf8WSrLkqqbLV7VYmC2fC05Qb-JQywLii8aERjpTz4SEg\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4Z2gMAqN8iZRqnwjBjgKRqrmcJ9wCpYE_aU8C2VFUjrqkLuv4i2as3mts-EdF8Em7_AFBytHapWRE8IZ15M0\"],null,[161,156,155,255]]],\"Java Edition Mod for Minecraft\",[\"4.5\",4.532258],\"Entertainment\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.richmcpe.java\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.richmcpe.java\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.richmcpe.java\"]],[\"qgJHGkUILkoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALICGQoXChFjb20ucmljaG1jcGUuamF2YRABGAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Bring the full Java Edition experience to your Bedrock world. This catalog delivers the deepest collection of java ui mod packs, combat overhauls, and parity fixes — all curated, tested, and updated as new content drops.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJava Edition UI\\u003cbr\\u003eTired of Bedrock\\u0026#39;s default menus? These resource packs transform every screen — inventory, hotbar, pause menu, and title screen — into an authentic java edition ui minecraft mod experience. A proper minecraft java inventory mod rebuilds the crafting grid, the equipment slots, and the item tooltips so everything lines up with what desktop players see. Packs like Bedrock UI+ rebuild the interface from scratch, while others target specific elements such as the offhand slot display or durability counters. If you have ever wanted java ui for minecraft mojang-style menus on mobile, this section is your starting point.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJava Advancements\\u003cbr\\u003eReplace Bedrock\\u0026#39;s flat achievement list with a proper branching tree. Java advancements for MCPE restore the original progression system — from \\u0026quot;Getting Wood\\u0026quot; all the way through \\u0026quot;How Did We Get Here\\u0026quot; — complete with challenge and goal categories. Every java advancement for minecraft is represented, so no milestone is missing. Whether you call them minecraft java achievement unlocks or just want the minecraft java advancement tab back, these packs slot right into Bedrock Edition without breaking vanilla gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJava Combat System\\u003cbr\\u003eThe java combat addon for minecraft pe brings attack cooldowns, weapon damage tiers, and shield timing back to mobile. No more spam-clicking — every swing counts. Raiyon s java combat addon is one standout example, praised for its accurate cooldown bar and damage scaling, but the catalog carries several alternatives. Crucially, the sweeping edge mod for minecraft pe is included as a component of these combat packs, restoring the area-of-effect sword mechanic that Bedrock removed, so group fights feel exactly like the desktop version.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDual Wielding and Offhand\\u003cbr\\u003eThe torch offhand addon v2.3 is the most requested update in this section — it lets you hold a light source in your left hand while mining or fighting, exactly how the Java offhand slot works on desktop. Beyond that specific release, every dual wield addon in the catalog supports food, totems, maps, and tools in the secondary slot. The dual wielding mod for minecraft options here are kept compatible with the latest Bedrock builds so nothing breaks after a game update.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJava Parity Textures and Sounds\\u003cbr\\u003eVisual and audio parity packs round out the experience. A complete minecraft java edition pack typically bundles corrected block models, item sprites, and UI icons into a single download. The mcpe java rpack entries in this category are particularly thorough — they address mob and player animations, fix mismatched textures, and include a Java Edition sounds resource pack covering block breaks, ambient cave audio, and UI clicks. Java animation mod for minecraft options fix mob and player animations to match the desktop renderer, and minecraft java texture pack entries correct the remaining visual gaps. Together they make MCPE feel indistinguishable from the desktop client.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCurated Catalog and Easy Install\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery mod ships with screenshots, a video preview, supported Minecraft version tags, and a one-tap open-in-game button for .mcpack, .mcworld, and .mcaddon files. Daily Tops surface what the community is installing right now; Trending, Underrated, Fresh, and Classic collections help you discover content beyond the obvious picks. Save favourites and bundle multiple files into a single .mcaddon package — no manual file management needed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to close the gap between Bedrock and Java? Explore the catalog and start building your perfect setup today.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.\"],\"richard7\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4Z2gMAqN8iZRqnwjBjgKRqrmcJ9wCpYE_aU8C2VFUjrqkLuv4i2as3mts-EdF8Em7_AFBytHapWRE8IZ15M0\"],null,[161,156,155,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.richmcpe.java\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.richmcpe.java\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],{\"102\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4Z2gMAqN8iZRqnwjBjgKRqrmcJ9wCpYE_aU8C2VFUjrqkLuv4i2as3mts-EdF8Em7_AFBytHapWRE8IZ15M0\"],null,[161,156,155,255]]]]}]],[[[\"com.mcpeturk.dilsecici\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tu5Hj9QXEvy8oKOhf_P9xcAT75vFwy7VamoapM4v-xOhnbu6U5QN4yyUJSpvmkqEdvvB3Mabs1986-gzfJUH6w\"],null,null,null,null,null,1],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mkwb7jbA9YNFBmicA5PpNE_ByNHoFw8q1I-tXAqAEjR4ONU1lHgiiuf0jFC2NBQPZuYWEV1OsOU9S3DZuTvyVw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jEQwz0DEREGXQEFe-fumiCfYN2ur07UnUlV_i623GYvovk9P1z12YqEkuWOpQJ3HtObS9lV-5yTM5dZgiPMchg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iO0_JE01VRd8zIjPO6oHs1hzj0ET5Hh-Klu3xZ-ITPpPk2zdqaNopv7OFvRptHlab_kFMEOlJmnf9yq0Obg8\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mkwb7jbA9YNFBmicA5PpNE_ByNHoFw8q1I-tXAqAEjR4ONU1lHgiiuf0jFC2NBQPZuYWEV1OsOU9S3DZuTvyVw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jEQwz0DEREGXQEFe-fumiCfYN2ur07UnUlV_i623GYvovk9P1z12YqEkuWOpQJ3HtObS9lV-5yTM5dZgiPMchg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iO0_JE01VRd8zIjPO6oHs1hzj0ET5Hh-Klu3xZ-ITPpPk2zdqaNopv7OFvRptHlab_kFMEOlJmnf9yq0Obg8\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iwbiC_Lir6rzgWfffeg2q0xtlruZM1Xqp1sytxK0DDHHJ1go59TqAWhREZixDBjwlVQnbLIHYT6wzc0ZuNI3Ow\"],null,[244,66,53,255]]],\"Addons Hub: Minecraft PE\",[\"2.9\",2.91],\"Tools\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mcpeturk.dilsecici\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mcpeturk.dilsecici\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mcpeturk.dilsecici\"]],[\"qgJMGkoIL0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8PoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAbICHgocChZjb20ubWNwZXR1cmsuZGlsc2VjaWNpEAEYAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🇹🇷 \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF9800\\\"\\u003eYıllardır Minecraft Pocket Edition\\u0026#39;ı İngilizce oynadık. Bu süre zarfında binlerce kişinin Minecraft PE\\u0026#39;ye Türkçe dil seçeneğinin gelmesini istediğini gördüm. Onlarca maile ve Change.org kampanyamıza cevap vermeyen Mojang\\u0026#39;ı beklemek yerine sizlere Minecraft CE sürümünden portlayıp eksik yüzlerce satırını çevirdiğim Türkçe MCPE eklentisini sunuyorum.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📰 \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003eBu uygulama sayesinde Minecraft PE\\u0026#39;a güncelleme gelse dahi güncel bir sekilde Türkçe oynayabileceksiniz. Sık sık güncellenen Türkçe dil dosyasıyla sizlere en iyi Minecraft PE Türkçe deneyimini yaşatacağım!\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003eNOT:\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003e Türkçe Dil: Minecraft PE uygulaması size Minecraft Pocket Edition\\u0026#39;u bedavaya sunmaz. Sadece MCPE\\u0026#39;yi Türkçe oynamanızı sağlar. Yamayı oylarken Türkçe Dil: Minecraft PE uygulamasının bedava Minecraft Pocket Edition sunmadığını unutmayın.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚠️ \\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003eBu uygulama stock Minecraft PE içinde bulunmayan bir dille çalışamaz. Örneğin oyunda önceden bulunmayan bir dil olan Vietnamese (vi_VN dil kodu) veya Türkçe dil: Minecraft PE uygulaması dışında kurulumu yapılmış bir Türkçe yama (olası tur_TR, tur_TUR, tr_TUR, tr, TUR dil kodu) bulunduran bir Minecraft PE clientinde bu uygulama çalışamaz. En başarılı kurulumu Minecraft PE Clientiniz içinden dil ayarlarınızı ingilizce ile değiştirip Türkçe Dil: Minecraft PE uygulamasıyla tekrar deneyerek yapabilirsiniz. Bu uygulamada kullanılan dil kodu tr_TR\\u0026#39;dir.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e❓ \\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#FF9800\\\"\\u003eGüncelle düğmesi tüm MCPE Türkçe yama kurulumunu sizin için olarak otomatik yapar. \\u003cbr\\u003e❓ MCPE Türkçe yamanın aktif olması için Türkçe Dil: Minecraft PE uygulamasından yamayı aktif et butonuna basın.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003eNEDEN 0.15.X VE ALTI İÇİN ÇALIŞMIYOR?\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003e 0.15.x\\u0026#39;te niye çalışmıyor hatta 0.14.x\\u0026#39;te niye çalışmıyor gibi birçok soru aldım. Ben de. BU yüzden bu soruyu cevaplamak istiyorum Minecraft PE 0.16.0 Betaları eklenip tam sürümde tam özellik kazanan yeni api desteğini kullanarak bu uygulamayı yazdım. O yüzden eski sürümlerde çalışma imkanı yoktur.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003eLütfen Minecraft Pocket Edition güncel sürümünü kullanın. Değişen Minecraft Pocket Edition manifest yapısı dolayısıyla eski sürümlerin otomatik kurulumu desteklenmemektedir.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#795548\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBu uygulamanın sponsor sunucusu TürkMCPE.net\\u0026#39;tir\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTürkçe Dil: Minecraft PE uygulaması Türkçe yama sağlamakla birlikte TürkMCPE Faction Sunucusunu direk Minecraft istemcinize ekleme özelliğine de sahiptir.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003eOTOMATIK KURULUM HAKKINDA\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#4caf50\\\"\\u003e Minecraft PE 1.0.3 sonrasında güvenlik sebeplerinden dolayı minecraftpe klasörünün sistem yoluna taşınması otomatik kurulumu engellemiştir. Bunun için gelecek sürümlerde ROOT destekli otomatik kurulum seçeneği eklenecek.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#F44336\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e-This app is not an official Minecraft product, not approved by or associated with Mojang.\\u003cbr\\u003e-Bu uygulama resmi bir Minecraft ürünü değildir, Mojang ile bir ilişkisi yoktur.\\u003cbr\\u003e-Screenshots in game images copyright owner is  © 2009-2016 Mojang AB / Mojang Synergies AB\\u003cbr\\u003e-Ekran görüntülerindeki oyun içi görüntülerinde bir oynama yapılmamış, ekran görüntülerindeki oyun içi görüntülerindeki doku ve resimlerin telif hakkı © 2009-2016 Mojang AB / Mojang Synergies AB \\u0026#39;ye aittir.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\"],\"KORATA Software\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iwbiC_Lir6rzgWfffeg2q0xtlruZM1Xqp1sytxK0DDHHJ1go59TqAWhREZixDBjwlVQnbLIHYT6wzc0ZuNI3Ow\"],null,[244,66,53,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mcpeturk.dilsecici\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mcpeturk.dilsecici\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.09 - $20.99 per item\",[false]],{\"102\":[null,[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iwbiC_Lir6rzgWfffeg2q0xtlruZM1Xqp1sytxK0DDHHJ1go59TqAWhREZixDBjwlVQnbLIHYT6wzc0ZuNI3Ow\"],