DF4EtZhAeKL7rJ-ieq7_c0OxYwbcKw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MHGr4OHs_-Hyw8Dyxvh7zbGypN10SQWgFtz8md4RHEnpP6AmvUnP6kV5g_h89qKw18PFpsBD9oIvpbx6xlSyXQ\"]]],\"Blockman Go\",[\"4.2\",4.204814],\"Arcade\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sandboxol.blockymods\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sandboxol.blockymods\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sandboxol.blockymods\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIARIgCh4KGGNvbS5zYW5kYm94b2wuYmxvY2t5bW9kcxABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],null,[null,\"Blockman GO is a free-to-play sandbox game that brings together mini games, social networking, and endless creativity in a vibrant block world. Whether you love action-packed PvP, survival challenges, or building your dream realm, Blockman GO has something for everyone.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Top Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Massive Collection of Mini Games\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay a wide variety of popular Minecraft-style games like Bed Wars, Sky Block, Egg Wars, and more. Join friends or team up with players from around the world. With frequent updates, there’s always a new adventure waiting!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧑\\u200d🎨 Fully Customizable Avatars\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock hundreds of stylish outfits, accessories, and skins. Express yourself and stand out in the online multiplayer community with your one-of-a-kind look.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌐 Global Social Experience\\u003cbr\\u003eMake new online friends through real-time chat, voice rooms, and group messaging. Enjoy a seamless chat app experience with AI-powered translation, making it easy to connect across languages and borders.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏠 Creative Room Building\\u003cbr\\u003eHost your own sandbox realm with free tools to build, customize, and invite others. Enjoy flexible game modes like PvP, parkour, survival, and casual hangouts—all within your own Minecraft-like server.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 Exciting Events \\u0026amp; Rewards\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin limited-time events to win exclusive outfits, coins, and vouchers. There’s always something new to collect and celebrate!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Why Choose Blockman GO?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Massive library of mini games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fully immersive sandbox building game\\u003cbr\\u003e- Built-in voice \\u0026amp; text chat system\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multiplayer social platform\\u003cbr\\u003e- Frequent updates and community events\\u003cbr\\u003e- Perfect for fans of Minecraft, Roblox, and creative world games\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Download Blockman GO now and start your adventure! Build, play, and connect with millions of players in the most creative block-style multiplayer world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEmail: bgofficialcontact@sandboxol.com \\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/officialblockmango\\u003cbr\\u003ewebsite: https://www.blockmango.net\"],\"Blockman GO studio\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TbDRL32U7ohXoubV-GXLcuxNp4x8BrsaPKnayOAZT-Lm3gW3BXlDK1-k47idWGlJQfwncN5Xqj4JYpOohK-QNGU\"],null,[167,152,154,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid