Ui2PDYuROQ\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmQslFlORLAXoV5CkWCJmqnFqlqWDu6yRYJQvooSCaUS0VHdqpHJ4YJgLuXTj5kvu88CerYhAr_zAXKZI4HNnGS9cSBI-ozaMroFFEp2z-SbECG8E7nddjQLaY2t5JbOn5Lh9gG7SnAU9J-09IalhWbkGNN4tbtivPCIKfh-dBCgnpA4fSQt_xSzceTC9Jm7GbM2pWKCqGBuSWG6Qhiynie9RN2P47tuGHiFYJRvTZGCrjuA3llq8ZC4yP7wxMZ8Y-jZr0_7STQq6ZIzmlhVyiGEsOtIKhn51pcgL1_C4zGMw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZUi2PDYuROQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Join 1,000,000+ players worldwide for thrilling online gaming! For all fans of gun games: Pixel Gun 3D is a fun first-person multiplayer action shooter. Download the game and enjoy blocky graphics, competitive gameplay, and much more:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔫 1000+ cool weapons\\u003cbr\\u003e💣 40 useful gadgets and tools\\u003cbr\\u003e🕹️ 10+ various game modes and gun games\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 10+ exciting mini-games\\u003cbr\\u003e🏰 100+ beautiful maps rotating during the year\\u003cbr\\u003e💀 Zombie-survival campaign\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👾 IMPOSTER MODE 👾 \\u003cbr\\u003eTrapped in the Spaceship with other players, you need to do some tasks to keep the ship working and return home. But there is an impostor in the team who will always interfere with your plans.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👑 ALL-NEW CLANS 👑\\u003cbr\\u003eUnite with friends and play together to get your clan to the top divisions and enjoy valuable prizes.\\u003cbr\\u003eUpdate and customize your Fort to resist PvE Sieges and create a powerful tank to raid other Clans’ forts.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ JOIN CLAN WARS! ⚔️\\u003cbr\\u003eConquer territories, control the huge global map, collect valor points, and gain income from your lands to win the war.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e🗡️ HUNDREDS OF WEAPONS 🗡️\\u003cbr\\u003eThere is an arsenal of more than 1000 different guns and other cool weapons in Pixel Gun 3D, and you can use all of them. Wanna shoot from a blaster pistol, use a medieval sword and shield or, maybe, the Dark Matter Generator? Just do it! And don’t forget about grenades..\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e😎 PLENTY OF SKINS 👽\\u003cbr\\u003eWould you like to be an Orc, a Skeleton, a mighty Amazon or someone else? Use extra-detailed skins and outfits to show off. Or create your own in the Skin Editor.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👾 GAME MODES 👾\\u003cbr\\u003eBattle Royale, Raids, Deathmatch, Duels… There are so many opportunities for you to challenge yourself. Not mentioning the brawls that rotate every week... Enjoy plenty of gun games in the world of PG3D!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎲 MINI-GAMES 🎲\\u003cbr\\u003eTired of being the best on a battlefield? It is time to participate in the competitions and show your fighting and shooting skills to every warrior worldwide. Sniper Tournament, Parkour Challenge, Glider Rush and other challenges await their hero!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFollow our news:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/PixelGun3DOfficial/\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/pixelgun3d_official/\\u003cbr\\u003eYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/PixelGun3DYT\\u003cbr\\u003eSupport: support.gp@cubicgames.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin one of the best gun games now and prepare for real action!\"],\"Pixel Gun 3D\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SSeD0E-DrjVboLm6w0VC98EcBtAi0MjE-f85E7Lm5_wHRsqv5ieOZr_cpHRdVhkfv8fmkYnaMtQs9_DCbdPR\"],null,[163,195,219,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https