l,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AuZJzu8mjNs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Bedwars is a teamwork PVP game, you will be battling your opponents on islands in the sky, protect your bed and try to destroy your opponents\\u0026#39; bed to prevent them from respawning, beat all the opponents to win the game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam Work⚔️\\u003cbr\\u003e16 players divided into 4 teams,spawning on different islands,build bridges with blocks to attack your opponents and contest the resources to upgrade your weapon and items so you can destroy your enemies\\u0026#39; beds more easily! Get matched in seconds to compete with players from all over the world, the challenger spots are waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiple Modes🏰\\u003cbr\\u003eSolo, Duo, Quad three modes in different maps that are picked randomly, different styles, different tactics, no matter you are solo queueing or queueing with your friends you can get matched in second and enjoy the addicting and intense game pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVariety of Items💣\\u003cbr\\u003ePurchase different types of blocks, weapons, tools, firebomb, traps, and more items with the resources you collected, different ways and tactics to defeat your opponents for you to discover.；Melee, ranged, techniques with different items, the only limitation is your imagination!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLive-time Chat😎\\u003cbr\\u003eCan\\u0026#39;t find buddies to play together? Bedwars has built-in chat systems,identify your language automatically and match you into the correct channel so you can communicate with players who speak the same language as you to make more friends online!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCustom Avatar🎲\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomized skins for multiple categories, thousands of avatar skins for you to choose from, there will be always one option fit for you, present yourself with a unique look in the Bedwars!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you have any fund problem or suggestions please contact us via email.\\u003cbr\\u003ebgofficialcontact@sandboxol.com\"],\"Blockman GO studio\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lP5gc93WuoCMHveW7uBBMpxNyUdofX-99XYlqU_HbyOq38hoiWlO8_ZJ8RL5rG7peyWrtCoLm__fPIj-augP7w\"],null,[171,240,249,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact, Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sandboxol.indiegame.bedwar\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sandboxol.indiegame.bedwar\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.09 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"com.mojang.minecraftedu\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JbaRbEMRaS8-9MT-jS7P_iiqgJZq1OVh6VM-OEaMuHj6em7JV3ZvuBHoFhg6z8lHCIG81d66boVJl7LUTQZJ\"],null,[192,153,94,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1364,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ab-yKOsmbrKSfSOucaBW_TTaLRPc_Y__BYIclR9GPPUa7qE-u2XJZKvFHCPENvmeX4BDhqFroX2KPgKP11-Bgw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5CxcvdNK-mpm2RPhEjgfKuN-Hpz2mgNA8-BaO-JKDFHvE223YY9-8SJF8Y9wceZVZ9Wqi0f5yaEwcSoDL0g9RKs\"]],[null,2,[1364,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9qjvZbbmvNKmBwJdLPEum8IHwR6cZDkZN4wvbq02psG-J56nupLDOw9eRYDnSglYIj6dJOQPGkgd-OJbV08v\"]],[null,2,[994,1905],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UA8rrL_gP5B7kDCnq09JaMfmBLpoXqile8NAio6-hMzEtxIE4OdVM95YtVJCfTyCU0YbtYTokd7ii_hZrieimPM\"]],[null,2,[1362,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DPJR2CdQsTeyAHNU0gtPlqCs1fT3qUho3Sgk2_ekJ0FvUYonzu1vKtsD_o_97QnIfqDCSsPxEDSW5rEd6kbjVg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BXTp7-WUP7a7XcRHYfli0FNyO64yAbNvE7BpVSETFX-pjlOuy5-7P6t5xnm0OeJuhgqeq0-nnAppTSQYt5s_gFQ\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rvGB4N7b13aZrgxiIeVcAHuSmaLyXRU0-7es51H-BqbSurkUoPx3lVLPLKyRiwOfEF7OvvXOhS1rxQ0gUlBbul8\"]]],\"Minecraft Education\",[\"4.1\",4.1255045],\"Education\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mojang.minecraftedu\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mojang.minecraftedu\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mojang.minecraftedu\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIBBIfCh0KF2NvbS5tb2phbmcubWluZWNyYWZ0ZWR1EAEYA0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8JoBEwj3x4D+0NqXAxWIrgoJHe7WEyv6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEACIAgTKAgIIBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"THIS APP IS FOR SCHOOL AND ORGANIZATIONAL USE. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinecraft Education is a game-based platform that inspires creative, inclusive learning through play. Explore blocky worlds that unlock new ways to tackle any subject or challenge. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into subjects like reading, math, history, and coding with lessons and standardized curriculum designed for all types of learners. Or explore and build together in creative open worlds.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUSE IT YOUR WAY\\u003cbr\\u003eWith hundreds of ready-to-teach lessons, creative challenges, and blank canvas worlds, there are lots of ways to make Minecraft Education work for your students. It’s easy to get started, no gaming experience necessary.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePREPARE STUDENTS FOR THE FUTURE\\u003cbr\\u003eHelp learners develop key key skills like problem solving, collaboration, digital citizenship, and critical thinking to help students them thrive now and in the future workplace. Spark a  passion for STEM.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME-BASED LEARNING\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock creativity and deep learning with immersive content created with partners including BBC Earth, NASA, and the Nobel Peace Center. Inspire students to engage in real-world topics with culturally relevant lessons and build challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES \\u003cbr\\u003e - Multiplayer mode enables collaboration in-game across platforms, devices, and hybrid environments \\u003cbr\\u003e - Code Builder supports block-based coding, JavaScript, and Python with intuitive interface and in-game execution\\u003cbr\\u003e - Immersive Reader helps players read and translate text \\u003cbr\\u003e - Camera and Book \\u0026amp; Quill items allow documentation and export of in-game-creations\\u003cbr\\u003e - Integration with Microsoft Teams and Flipgrid supports assessment and teacher controls\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinecraft Education licenses can be purchased with Admin access to a Microsoft 365 Admin Center account. Talk to your Tech Lead for information on academic licensing. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: The terms that apply to this download are the terms that were presented when you purchased your Minecraft Education subscription.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy: https://aka.ms/privacy\"],\"Mojang\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"Ages 9+\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FHNXao7_mUhFPiitEDkiGvZSWT3e27rJuyexIZhw1YBT0V_