ltimate Sandbox of Chaos!\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Melon Sandbox, a thrilling sandbox game where you unleash your creativity through brutal experiments with realistic ragdoll physics! No limits, no rules—just pure destructive fun!\\u003cbr\\u003eMelon Sandbox x Poppy Playtime™: Halloween Collaboration!\\u003cbr\\u003eThis Halloween, Melon Sandbox collaborates with Poppy Playtime for a special Halloween event! Enter a spooky world featuring iconic Poppy Playtime characters, including Huggy Wuggy, Kissy Missy, The Prototype, Boxy Boo, and more.\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on Halloween-themed board game challenges, unlock exclusive characters and mods, and bring the world of Poppy Playtime into your favorite physics sandbox!\\u003cbr\\u003e🧨 What can you do?\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Experiment with physics – Throw, smash, and test unique interactions between objects!\\u003cbr\\u003e🔫 Massive arsenal – Use firearms, melee weapons, explosives, and vehicles to tear through ragdolls!\\u003cbr\\u003e💣 Create chaos – Stab, crush, burn, or vaporize with custom devices!\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Open-world sandbox – Explore diverse maps and build your own playground of destruction!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready for endless mayhem in the ultimate ragdoll simulation! Get on board now and start experimenting! 🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e™ \\u0026amp; © 2021–2026 Mob Entertainment, Inc.\"],\"playducky.com\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k39LHb_xjIayh2Rvrs_pXLElxmeA6bm1wkG1Cn9u9IYc5zwCGWYsyGKNbl0DFbI0UQc18QpTh6qi48VkS_uloFs\"],null,[34,2,3,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[