9HalwMVeQezBh0daiLwmgETCPfHgP7Q2pcDFYiuCgkd7tYTK/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dRDGFFrH2hGU\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RDGFFrH2hGU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Join Trainers across the globe who are discovering Pokémon as they explore the world around them. Pokémon GO is the global gaming sensation that has been downloaded over 1 billion times and named “Best Mobile Game” by the Game Developers Choice Awards and “Best App of the Year” by TechCrunch.\\u003cbr\\u003e_______________\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUncover the world of Pokémon: Explore and discover Pokémon wherever you are!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eCatch more Pokémon to complete your Pokédex!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eJourney alongside your Buddy Pokémon to help make your Pokémon stronger and earn rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete in epic Gym battles and...Team up with other Trainers to catch powerful Pokémon during Raid Battles!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s time to get moving—your real-life adventures await! Let’s GO!\\u003cbr\\u003e_______________\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNotes: \\u003cbr\\u003e- This app is free-to-play and offers in-game purchases. It is optimized for smartphones, not tablets.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compatible with Android devices that have 2GB RAM or more and have Android Version 6.0–10.0+ installed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compatibility is not guaranteed for devices without GPS capabilities or devices that are connected only to Wi-Fi networks.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Application may not run on certain devices even if they have compatible OS versions installed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- It is recommended to play while connected to a network in order to obtain accurate location information.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compatibility information may be changed at any time.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Please visit PokemonGO.com for additional compatibility information. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Information current as of October 20, 2020.\"],\"Scopely Explore, Inc.\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-OaZO0LJ9CSRrNBS8yJhryciXUzrf2vJvgxvO2CahoDEwVQEgxHCS0n_MKbmIVkSvP0tb9meCdflxBAT8-O5xZA\"],null,[248,223,199,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nianticlabs.pokemongo\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.nianticlabs.pokemongo\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"info.flowersoft.theotown.theotown\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xLCN4S3WJujOSGArYJ7dCcKlDeHhXk8EtRwZn_rtSBGmTEKSpufvCz1VX1UZ68epVe0CgZ5R6KBZg5G1t99X\"],null,[85,79,77,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[921,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mFZeczZF0En4aAPm8OXeXn8rFT0AJIOjqTiDBllOI7nHbaiT7CiPusUpVveROsnT5EdAUcWMLi_2zdzysOk16g\"]],[null,2,[922,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZJOYCIduBIuwE0T6DxL2YpszAzudw2LNxyyDQSZ99dNC9GYhZoVxsUGB-tQIo1gGVjqe4ij1m4V9ldcP11Kwfg\"]],[null,2,[1423,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a65aMIrOBA-M2HRUHRmdIeWm9cnwFpB19g-V5kj6IehgEtudTPIsh5LaUv6zX49kgdI9D9BTwT3o1fV9Cp9FFw\"]],[null,2,[926,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2r3DxhooeSPQuF1V6P19OWk3UjndmH6WkjsYRz8qU96ZcnFybANsL4TOvn3XFsH2R_pC2SpdXPrXn7AIZ57wWg\"]],[null,2,[922,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IWKM8gwJezs3RA0EutELnCub1QGluGZE2cvPXx2sAK4ma4F1mCulwfo9gZ0JhbYz6zpOnncf24G0D4khfGQL\"]],[null,2,[922,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7zUM-9fxn4K75lRFGpEvhdDw7KLXcv_0_LJ0xTmczz25_h7bSDQsMWugxHzOsq53HgmDp3BFhrdHVG6Sify6nw\"]]],\"TheoTown: City Builder\",[\"4.7\",4.7243004],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dinfo.flowersoft.theotown.theotown\\u0026rdid\\u003dinfo.flowersoft.theotown.theotown\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dinfo.flowersoft.theotown.theotown\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIChIpCicKIWluZm8uZmxvd2Vyc29mdC50aGVvdG93bi50aGVvdG93bhABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eBUILD YOUR OWN CITY IN A DETAILED CITY SIMULATION\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a city building game focused on freedom, scale, and long-term development. \\u003cb\\u003eTheoTown\\u003c/b\\u003e lets you build a city from scratch—whether it’s a small town, a growing metropolis, or something entirely your own. Inspired by classic city builders, TheoTown combines intuitive tools with deep simulation systems. From towering skyscrapers to simple residential blocks, every part of your city is shaped by your decisions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDESIGN CITIES WITH ZONES, ROADS, AND PUBLIC BUILDINGS 🌆\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTheoTown is about planning and experimentation. As your city grows, you decide how districts are laid out, how neighborhoods connect, and how the city evolves over time. Few city simulation games offer this level of freedom to build, change, and rebuild without artificial limits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003ePLAN TRANSPORTATION \\u0026amp; INFRASTRUCTURE 🚈\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA functioning city depends on movement. Build roads, highways, railways, and airports to connect different parts of your city. TheoTown challenges you to design efficient transportation networks and manage traffic flow as your city expands.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHANDLE EMERGENCIES AND KEEP THE CITY RUNNING 🚒\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCity life isn’t always predictable. Disasters can happen, emergencies arise, and public safety must be maintained. Build fire stations, police departments, and hospitals to respond to events and keep your city operational.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eBUILD LANDMARKS AND CUSTOMIZE YOUR WORLD 🌍\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConstruct famous landmarks, unique structures, and customize your game using community-made plugins. TheoTown supports a wide range of play styles, from realistic city layouts to creative and experimental designs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ch4\\u003eTHEOTOWN GAME FEATURES:\\u003c/h4\\u003e - Flexible City Building – Create anything from small towns to large megacities with detailed layouts and varied architecture. - Transportation Systems – Build and connect roads, railways, and airports; manage trains, buses, and planes. - Emergencies \\u0026amp; Events – Deal with fires, natural disasters, crime, and other city challenges. - Famous Landmarks – Build well-known structures such as Big Ben, the Eiffel Tower, and the Statue of Liberty. - User-Made Plugins – Expand the game with community-created buildings and features. - Sports Facilities – Build stadiums that add character and activity to your city. - Energy Systems – Power your city using different energy sources, from traditional plants to advanced solutions. - Public Services – Establish police stations, fire departments, and hospitals. - Open-Ended Gameplay – Unlock new content as your city grows, with long-term simulation depth. - Community \\u0026amp; Sharing – Take screenshots of your cities and explore creations made by other players.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTheoTown is made for fans of city simulation, urban planning, and thoughtful building games. Take your time, experiment, and shape a city that grows in its own way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉\\u003cb\\u003eDownload and play TheoTown free and offline!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin Our Community:\\u003cbr\\u003eForum: https://forum.theotown.com/\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://facebook.com/theotowngame\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://instagram.com/theotowngame\\u003cbr\\u003eFAQ: https://theo.town/faq\"],\"blueflower\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G05srwPU1uF-57KG5BGc0uWXxNH_6WippA5hbqpUkLd2K9ykj4dF2efLz-nh6Ybg4T85SmyqiujizIrKaqAUHw\"],null,[58,90,75,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"U