ails?id\\u003dcom.mojang.minecraftedu_preview\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mojang.minecraftedu_preview\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mojang.minecraftedu_preview\"]],[\"qgJqGmgICxInCiUKH2NvbS5tb2phbmcubWluZWNyYWZ0ZWR1X3ByZXZpZXcQARgDShMI9Yyfy9HalwMVeQezBh0daiLwmgETCPfHgP7Q2pcDFYiuCgkd7tYTK/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"THIS APP IS FOR SCHOOL AND ORGANIZATIONAL USE. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinecraft Education Preview allows you to experience upcoming new features, fresh from the development team at Mojang Studios! Please note the following information about Minecraft Education Preview:\\u003cbr\\u003e - You will not be able to join non-Preview player’s games\\u003cbr\\u003e - Most settings will not be preserved from the retail version of Minecraft Education\\u003cbr\\u003e - Any worlds played in Preview will not transfer to the retail version of Minecraft Education\\u003cbr\\u003e - Lessons from the Library will work in Preview\\u003cbr\\u003e - Preview builds may be unstable and do not represent final version quality\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinecraft Education licenses can be purchased with Admin access to a Microsoft 365 Admin Center account. Talk to your Tech Lead for information on academic licensing. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: The terms that apply to this download are the terms that were presented when you purchased your Minecraft Education subscription.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy: https://aka.ms/privacy\"],\"Mojang\",\"10,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5u2irGmAJBnoNYZsZ15qOrUWJsDt6rghmlTA9V7SM2Qj9QQYhS_9PCWGFz5-952nver1_dKYSixpmbMYd0lFd7I\"],null,[92,134,32,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1san