NluNJqy5dauWS5_FMa38ssGuJc35jV9RFn1Mk-nl7GGgyuJcKFgHgGhs_iESBxqtTFSqdQ\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kkuzmP2yu3rf2p1Giq3kyX6IZN82lSsc9EjvEY5Q6zGxkpzjLkVqO0IU0VGp7qnukIduwEYYpMFqVOkPAlV4Gw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t4jhiDCVzyEzNdUyUCCorbj7mKzliBPxRP3qZcbnX4SfQ63hdzw2b86AKnag_ceMGzA7V18HCcjmTS16djiayRw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2pUs4wqMCw0HKSGBF9_GEJMzdpeanrKn3rY3ejM0C4slwST75INGPFf4wHyD_oumf8Z8Y3Lga_BgmkdYGdWHvu0\"]]],\"PK XD: Fun, friends \\u0026 games\",[\"4.7\",4.6945286],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.movile.playkids.pkxd\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.movile.playkids.pkxd\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.movile.playkids.pkxd\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIDBIgCh4KGGNvbS5tb3ZpbGUucGxheWtpZHMucGt4ZBABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],[[[null,null,\"57TJgXX6_uI\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/57TJgXX6_uI?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:57TJgXX6_uI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlZGMy9rEYwBFUOg8-fQNGRCHscQHFxNp9pwmSZkYXXOuQrqgHEJ5gbG2N6lWAF-HnJqtenD8DpknA7VRplSFccA-EYKJXV6IiVWuVLx7lUuadMbH-iPhUTrlaE_9rb5OM7s9_UDm58izKIoutzcbqEcATbDnmBCD3k1OPxUGBlAPih0zXBGn3OkYMW1HpOngwvOjE2onI4ZjvDs0ht7Svo4oM5NnErYEJre-hzpXx83a26k8gJKdrzQfWwZUHwzRy7cV8zxRHBLBsQjP-PyxhbVzkGp-7Qe8e6VxgZmYZcAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/57TJgXX6_uI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"PK XD is a creative kids game set in a colorful virtual world where imagination, role play, and fun come together.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesigned as a safe and family-friendly game, PK XD allows kids to explore an open world, create their own avatar, and enjoy creative adventures through play, storytelling, and social interaction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this open world kids game, children can design characters, build spaces, play mini games, and roleplay different activities in a safe environment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePK XD is a virtual world where creativity leads the experience, encouraging kids to express themselves while playing freely with friends and family.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE YOUR AVATAR AND EXPRESS YOUR CREATIVITY! Within the game, you will have the opportunity to create your own avatar and express your personality in a unique way! Do you want to be a human avatar, a zombie avatar, or even a unicorn avatar? Let your imagination flow and mix and match fun clothes and accessories. Use colorful hair, fantastic wings, armor, swords, and explore the PK XD World. Be whoever you want to be and experience various professions such as an influencer avatar, astronaut avatar, scientist avatar, chef avatar, and much more. Hit play and let the fun begin!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE AND EXPLORE AMAZING GAMES Have fun with your friends in exciting challenges like crazy races and pizza deliveries, among others! In PK XD, there are always new games for you to enjoy! And if you thought of something that doesn\\u0026#39;t exist in our PK XD World yet, don\\u0026#39;t worry, you can create your own experience in PK XD Builder! Create mini-games, amusement parks, soccer fields, or even a shopping mall. Here, there are no limits to your creativity. With so many games to explore, the fun is guaranteed!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE AND BUILD THE PERFECT HOUSE AND HAVE YOUR FAVORITE VEHICLE IN THE GAME How about building your dream house within the game? In PK XD, your avatar can have a pool, a game room, a playground, and many other incredible details like wallpapers, fantastic sofas and bean bags, fun paintings, and much more. Besides that, you can also have amazing vehicles like skateboards, scooters, cars, rollerblades, or motorcycles to keep in your garage. Explore and live this unique experience. The fun is guaranteed!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHAVE YOUR OWN VIRTUAL PET IN THE GAME Ever imagined combining two pets and creating a unique virtual creature? In the PK XD World, you can have a lot of fun with your pet! The more you take care of your pet, the more it can evolve and transform into a fantastic animal! In the PK XD game, you can play with your family and also have a virtual pet to take care of. Hit play in the game and let the fun begin!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSPECIAL EVENTS AND UPDATES Special dates become even more amazing in the PK XD World! Make sure your avatar and your family celebrate Halloween, Christmas, Easter, our anniversary, and many other exclusive events with themed items within the game! Stay tuned for all the news!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJOIN THE COOLEST GAMER COMMUNITY Build the game with us! We want to hear all your suggestions to offer the best possible experience for you and your family!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn PK XD, children\\u0026#39;s safety is our priority. We comply with data protection laws and ensure a safe environment for players to enjoy their virtual adventures. We maintain the privacy and protection of our players\\u0026#39; personal data. For more information about our policies, please visit: \\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://policies.playpkxd.com/en/privacy/3.0. For our terms of service, please visit: https://policies.playpkxd.com/en/terms/2.0. Have fun with peace of mind and confidence, as we are committed to providing a safe environment for all our players!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us to stay updated on all the news: @pkxd.universe\"],\"Afterverse Games\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wrPf4b2cI108hm3tS_1JsOkWua9PRYngLU3ODoeT5bme7w3HRcVAEPgzvdIYKqd2QDlvw66gtIKie3mMM6KtJWc\"],null,[129,209,22,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Crude Humor\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.movile.playkids.pkxd\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.movile.playkids.pkxd\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.29 - $399.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"com.dts.freefireth\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cK-U0_B9GrnSy26SNISDuvU_hL4VggyqJ1J5V2oiuyVEfiGo7fzegdBjk0ejXPg3PKK5sPwumdLBbWv8KkBKLQ\"],null,[252,245,178,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1600,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LsawRbqk_iyOjjY_NkmKv62sTH9U4WqaF9juPzT0nhN4u9v52SHAfQliNaKpYZgo4KPN2j-cLVI44PhKpuAGJQ\"]],[null,2,[1600,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8wCWhv0r5MAwGGIlL_H-wyQaiKDr4DlNdw3zKlCRu1YfT44aW_sq9ZWeIwku5aNpPTgZSZmp5_s1dgh4OnRT\"]],[null,2,[1600,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PQkJeCIIB0ycrqPDKEnwhhLeCYXj0q2h5HB5oGxRPEplPe0EdZd5eYCb5WCAbB-UeNHqfeyIzXWC1Hn3afLg\"]],[null,2,[1600,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercon