h0KF2NvbS5lYS5nYW1lLnB2emZyZWVfcm93EAEYA0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8JoBEwj3x4D+0NqXAxWIrgoJHe7WEyv6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAA\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"ZTU3oDHveM8\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZTU3oDHveM8?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:ZTU3oDHveM8\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezluCEWbDRgDyss1dhhnWJ9X6PkdghWm9VZU5ejra9QKc9C56fgZ1yGsV2Wj5i6QYWCR2J8HWs8BMfVJtmBDyyraTDD8cecyn81g2hN8iNf2GpyCH3HQpFe2qp4L-2rfsG7lKfrNUmBLBGAylu8LE2epVcjl8l790etjZc5LCm2lBF2UgV92_ka54tRmOGNWO4Lm6rLBLTaoOX8CsFRFIgu14AtnUpxZHNwj3nFTNC9tccwLOKaKQxCDK575yXU3mCiT8lZhHsolnhQ_mWmWYMaSebNeUpbmfoTb5p66OYSjHw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZTU3oDHveM8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to soil your plants as a mob of fun-loving zombies is about to invade your home. Use your arsenal of 49 zombie-zapping plants — Peashooters, Wall-nuts, Cherry bombs and more — to mulchify 26 types of zombies before they break down your door.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app offers in-app purchases. You may disable in-app purchasing using your device settings\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWINNER OF OVER 30 GAME OF THE YEAR AWARDS*\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e50 FUN-DEAD LEVELS\\u003cbr\\u003eConquer all 50 levels of Adventure mode — through day, night, fog, in a swimming pool, on the rooftop and more. Plus fend off a continual wave of zombies as long as you can with Survival mode!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNOT GARDEN-VARIETY GHOULS\\u003cbr\\u003eBattle zombie pole-vaulters, snorkelers, bucketheads and 26 more fun-dead zombies. Each has its own special skills, so you\\u0026#39;ll need to think fast and plant faster to combat them all.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSMARTER THAN YOUR AVERAGE ZOMBIE\\u003cbr\\u003eBe careful how you use your limited supply of greens and seeds. Zombies love brains so much they\\u0026#39;ll jump, run, dance, swim and even eat plants to get into your house. Open the Almanac to learn more about all the zombies and plants to help plan your strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFIGHT LONGER, GET STRONGER\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn 49 powerful perennials as you progress and collect coins to buy a pet snail, power-ups and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGROW WITH YOUR GAME\\u003cbr\\u003eShow off your zombie-zapping prowess by earning 46 awesome achievements.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCOIN PACKS\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed coins for great new stuff? Buy up to 600,000 coins right from the Main Menu.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*Original PC downloadable game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBe the first to know! Get inside EA info on great deals, plus the latest game updates, tips \\u0026amp; more\\u003cbr\\u003eVISIT US: ea.com\\u003cbr\\u003eFOLLOW US: twitter.com/eamobile\\u003cbr\\u003eLIKE US: facebook.com/eamobile\\u003cbr\\u003eWATCH US: youtube.com/eamobilegames\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRequires acceptance of EA’s Privacy \\u0026amp; Cookie Policy and User Agreement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUser Agreement: terms.ea.com\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://help.ea.com/ for assistance or inquiries.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEA may retire online features and services after 30 days’ notice posted on www.ea.com/1/service-updates\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImportant Consumer Information. This app contains direct links to the Internet.\"],\"ELECTRONIC ARTS\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RmJiUF3EFEMyggCoSL3cCoX3A4sTZgHbBJn4JzcB7oCmZvCGajQ_AFYYa0qkkUdyrZLLhQAM4EwoE4-gvLBC\"],null,[108,197,237,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Mi