\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"9RzAgcnK-fU\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9RzAgcnK-fU?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:9RzAgcnK-fU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmWQat_utJ2KYwg-oZEqoib06AlFAsZuslPf-ZgVj1bD46ZuQqdkbPRWN8XhE3ZyrRXREh6DLPMBPT8yh4ev8ty0HY2wDDmVo2Kwz9GSrtybD0F-L4liaGMrRFXuUuodjBjEsO8IrCHeQs0IAxV5FMgD3v2_jTCIK3agFxXmATeOaB6jEMoe4wvN7Jd7F378mpe6Lk3EpwA8lZG1TGxYrKsJJsiMScvw17TPmGNnSioF1qDxzXtX24utGSSQHElKSIvuTVJPtTdR6HwuWubj3TrQsxa5RNy_xH5v45DSCmoZA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9RzAgcnK-fU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eWorldBox\\u003c/b\\u003e is a free god and simulation Sandbox game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this free Sandbox god game you can \\u003cb\\u003ecreate life and watch it prosper!\\u003c/b\\u003e Spawn sheep, wolves, orks, elfs, dwarves and other magic creatures!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCivilizations\\u003c/b\\u003e can craft and build houses, roads and go to war with each other. Help them survive, evolve and build powerful civilization!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eThe Sandbox.\\u003c/b\\u003e Play around with different powers. You can dissolve ground with acid rain or even drop an atomic bomb! Spawn tornados, underground worms or a Heat ray. Enjoy creative destruction or craft worlds full of life!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWatch\\u003c/b\\u003e how classic Conway\\u0026#39;s Game of Life can quickly destroy world civilization. Or create Langton\\u0026#39;s ant cellular automata\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSimulate\\u003c/b\\u003e various disasters. Meteorites, volcanos, lava, tornados, geysers and more. Simulate and watch evolution of creatures and the rise of civilizations\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCraft a pixel world\\u003c/b\\u003e. You can build pixel art world using different free tools, magic and brushes. Just use different pixel types for coloring. Be creative!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eExperiment\\u003c/b\\u003e in your own Sandbox game. Play with different creatures and powers in magic world simulation\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBecome a God\\u003c/b\\u003e of your own pixel art world. Create life and build civilization of different mythological races. Build a world of your dreams!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can play this Sandbox game offline without wi fi or internet connection\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Super WorldBox - God Game for FREE!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you are experiencing any problems, please do get in contact with me here: supworldbox@gmail.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLeave your feedback or suggestions if you want to see more powers and creatures in this free Sandbox game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLink to our website and social media accounts:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWebsite: https://www.superworldbox.com\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/worldbox\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/superworldbox\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter: https://twitter.com/Mixamko\\u003cbr\\u003eReddit: https://reddit.com/r/worldbox\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/superworldbox/ \\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter: https://twitter.com/superworldbox\"],\"Mako Mako\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/herr2Xbs95WNsND4aJKVdOjMkK_KusoNY-HzfLVL4adEaQ2daGrKjgFuCdIOZRlOETyKV8JVTehs2VQNaLIJwg\"],null,[124,161,224,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,n