ull,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IZjki13COK0CUrfSSpkjVzyiMzIolPclzEsfPD-WgJWFRb7J2tlCvgkZrnC4vWLBuolxcZVR05mwErgORzgx\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/STr6qnbi5-2_eUIcg7oRIQnuAptzwkD5r3aFNCFTJJ9jG558RV9YYdyTqFrpIKJhw_A-IGgEgv3he0m6yug1gg\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/baMQ8X_ZLNeMxX1NSFTVhCXFElb9geDZamFCe9FXPaZChoPnmhyKFOGyHG81SE-9e0_3vpytATu7WSAbrABy\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aG_dZTLiwVpwEqy9qnQ48fdzdCL0OsgyG2MjXRqTAW3lkqQbeFu-jz3v15iDGjpJFpue1qCeQyjJMv23OpPY\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aO2Evb7Zghu8B9mIs_aNbfFDqF5qsP2gWq1TPrekFe3SN41j6wZh7vmukqOWBiZ1Y4wFjkHut2ckOdye5TsTVzw\"]]],\"Genshin Impact 6th Anniversary\",[\"3.3\",3.3142343],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miHoYo.GenshinImpact\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.miHoYo.GenshinImpact\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miHoYo.GenshinImpact\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIHhIgCh4KGGNvbS5taUhvWW8uR2Vuc2hpbkltcGFjdBABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],[[[null,null,\"dEmdy3phWWE\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dEmdy3phWWE?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:dEmdy3phWWE\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlhS7Xj-otAYEfecEvibVzhHNilpWZx8a0m7IEu5ptNEWDa6UEP2a8cW6jIhH55sq9IQf4kVY2b5bTtgP6Acv5r-OKU8geFl-UNKDk-6fnkrUmqOwn9cQlkV2faY9-zHn8v-pxusa84pB5Saef3DhtuEjDDAJzGzjPiAHkxX5xE70x8lqldVVogOteNXi92qv-cjoDogG6u_VRCgWM2oz5pIpRMLEBOdBh74reNXyVzSNTq5pK0D5smeYNnYdluABJtnTjashqdxey6XkGYYUcGt4YjqwYJ6PBxYCG7o2xnAg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dEmdy3phWWE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"This game includes optional in-game purchases, including random virtual items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into Teyvat, a vast world teeming with life and flowing with elemental energy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou and your sibling arrived here from another world. Separated by an unknown god, stripped of your powers, and cast into a deep slumber, you now awake to a world very different from when you first arrived.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThus begins your journey across Teyvat to seek answers from The Seven — the gods of each element. Along the way, prepare to explore every inch of this wondrous world, join forces with a diverse range of characters, and unravel the countless mysteries that Teyvat holds...\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMASSIVE OPEN WORLD\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClimb any mountain, swim across any river, and glide over the world below, taking in the jaw-dropping scenery each step of the way. And if you stop to investigate a wandering Seelie or strange mechanism, who knows what you might discover?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eELEMENTAL COMBAT SYSTEM\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHarness the seven elements to unleash elemental reactions. Anemo, Electro, Hydro, Pyro, Cryo, Dendro, and Geo interact in all sorts of ways, and Vision wielders have the power to turn this to their advantage.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWill you vaporize Hydro with Pyro, electro-charge it with Electro, or freeze it with Cryo? Your mastery of the elements will give you the upper hand in battle and exploration.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBEAUTIFUL VISUALS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeast your eyes on the world around you, with a stunning art style, real-time rendering, and finely tuned character animations delivering you a truly immersive visual experience. Lighting and weather all change naturally over time, bringing every detail of this world to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSOOTHING SOUNDTRACK\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLet the beautiful sounds of Teyvat draw you in as you explore the expansive world around you. Performed by the world\\u0026#39;s top orchestras such as London Philharmonic Orchestra and Shanghai Symphony Orchestra, the soundtrack changes seamlessly with the time and gameplay to match the mood.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR DREAM TEAM\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with a diverse cast of characters in Teyvat, each with their own unique personalities, stories, and abilities. Discover your favorite party combinations and level up your characters to help you conquer even the most daunting of enemies and domains.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJOURNEY WITH FRIENDS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with friends across various platforms to trigger more elemental action, tackle tricky boss fights, and conquer challenging domains together to reap rich rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you stand atop the peaks of Jueyun Karst and take in the rolling clouds and vast terrain stretching out before you, you may wish to stay in Teyvat a little longer... But until you are reunited with your lost sibling, how can you rest? Go forth, Traveler, and begin your adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWANDER THE THOUSAND STARS, SHAPE MYRIADS OF WONDERLANDS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter Miliastra Wonderland — a dreamlike realm of adventure, creation, and socializing. Customize your Manekins, meet friends in the Lobby, tackle challenges in various stages, or craft your own unique worlds in the Miliastra Sandbox!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSUPPORT\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you encounter any issues during the game, you can send us feedback via the in-game Customer Service Center.\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer Service Email: genshin_cs@hoyoverse.com\\u003cbr\\u003eOfficial Site: https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/\\u003cbr\\u003eForums: https://www.hoyolab.com/\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Genshinimpact/\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/genshinimpact/\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter: https://twitter.com/GenshinImpact\\u003cbr\\u003eYouTube: http://www.youtube.com/c/GenshinImpact \\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/genshinimpact\\u003cbr\\u003eReddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/Genshin_Impact/\"],\"COGNOSPHERE PTE. LTD.\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aEHfZ8ZvxjlvA7fyrcYL6Doc2_-WlEK3vJZEQLPXB5mV3LJ80fKSsrnSHSHyZHsCqt_pqIiHmHzVRqZLUswDgg\"],null,[230,233,240,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence, Alcohol Reference\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.miHoYo.GenshinImpact\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.miHoYo.GenshinImpact\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false],[]]],[[\"com.lordix.addonsforminecraftpe\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S2-2JjHaaGKEFzVq7hXnUoCu4Dm4z9xeETtIOF1h18cQjpInRGem33qTFbxmJxbTtC93GZm9D2eVm5-0jsIhlA\"],null,[80,41,23,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuserconte