l,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.lordix.addonsforminecraftpe\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.lordix.addonsforminecraftpe\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.lordix.addonsforminecraftpe\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIHxInCiUKH2NvbS5sb3JkaXguYWRkb25zZm9ybWluZWNyYWZ0cGUQARgDShMI9Yyfy9HalwMVeQezBh0daiLwmgETCPfHgP7Q2pcDFYiuCgkd7tYTK/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"The Minecraft Mods application contains the newest mcpe addons and mods for minecraft. Free addons is a collection of addons for minecraft mod is which support all versions and all devices. Our application contains only free mcpe mod. Also in application there is a search function. When you installed addons for minecraft it gives you access to following categories of mcpe addons:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFurniture\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn the application addons for mcpe there is a category of furniture mod, where you can download all sort of mods for Minecraft furniture. This category places inside sofas, armchairs, chairs, computer equipment, shelves, steps, stairs, flowers, paintings, windows, tabers. To download Minecraft mods, simply click on download button, and then import it – all happens automatically. These additions are also called furniture mod for mcpe and are among of most popular game category. It will help you to make your home more unique and comfort.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWeapons\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn guns section you will find guns for pocket edition that you need. Guns for mcpe diversify gameplay, in this category exist knives, pistols, machine guns, rifles, grenades, swords, grenade launchers, explosives, shotgun, improved bows, crossbows, hammers and others mods for minecraft. If there are any problems installing free addons, then most likely you need to enable experimental mode in world settings. Guns will add to the game a lot of weapons and ammunition which are so lacking in game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCars\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFind the latest and only the most interesting one car for minecraft mod. Cars are represented by different types of sports and other cars. Also, you will find not just cars but all sort of vehicles that were created for pocket edition, such as special equipment, helicopters, special vehicles, airplanes, motorcycles, quadrocopters, jetpacks, ships, trains, carts and all about vehicles. The section also presents motorcycles and other mcpe cars. All you need it download our Minecraft mods, download free addon that you like and import it with one click installation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003ePopulars\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePopular, as it follows from its name, places inside only the most popular, downloaded and interesting mods for minecraft. Content from this category is selected according to two criteria: the ratio of the number of downloads and positive user reviews that you can see via likes right in front of each item and also on the item screen. In each Minecraft mod you will find: furniture mod, addons for mcpe, cars, too much tnt, lucky block mod, tnt and others.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAnimals\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAmong other categories this is the cutest ones! There is you will find: cute pets, prehistoric animals and other animals including horse, puppies, cats, farm animals and also creations like robot and mutants!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eOther\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlso here has many other contents: TNT, Animals, Mutants, Transport, Portal Gun, Swords, Pets, Lucky Blocks, and other. This category contains all items that didn’t fit in others, but that doesn\\u0026#39;t mean they\\u0026#39;re bad! On the contrary, here you\\u0026#39;ll find Minecraft mods that are the most interesting and unusual!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe really hope you enjoy our app and leave a positive review if you like it!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDISCLAIMER\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is an unofficial app. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, Brand, Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance with https://www.minecraft.net/usage-guidelines#terms-brand_guidelines.\"],\"Addons and Mods for Minecraft\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3MmT7T2QwRsRk2DaIehXqd34Wz3nsGx7oG0CI7HIEo9DcrpyQNI6urp24k-Vk-xLZ6qIYTe3rjKKi0rGgN2xQWI\"],null,[90,79,79,255],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,true],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.lordix.addonsforminecraftpe\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.lordix.addonsforminecraftpe\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $39.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"com.ohbibi.fps\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://pla