WChQKDmNvbS5vaGJpYmkuZnBzEAEYA0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8JoBEwj3x4D+0NqXAxWIrgoJHe7WEyv6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAA\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"2TUqPdTNN7k\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2TUqPdTNN7k?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:2TUqPdTNN7k\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlK37TsZiOofOnjjcM0d1PLQ50vrr8cps8VfE2EuMOwbdPnP-qvf-vou7AQFv9frZTwcExn2PttCPmt8O6ZsVgELUA-B3gDlxp2i0SOAsIFFJ11Ig7PcqO9CRmk4gZoM8MdsTyFYKlteBuaAax9RJDAqRkaZfRjqy6N7DrtDhTeIuyGSR1TO2jbrHv5mDcd86Vs7RrDcWo6mzfivoFbfbkzTuCAEbk4lfCD_U_SNeNNu4WIHaMh8eyPcqrvDckn7VsReL-Dftyofz6CP30_WzBX19qSPcW2hLZ0oepPtKThNw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2TUqPdTNN7k/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"FRAG is a free PvP hero game. Choose your hero, create your team, enter the arena, and start the combat. Discover FRAG, the FPS and TPS battle game by Oh BiBi!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay explosive 1v1 duels against players worldwide in this FPS and TPS game designed for your phone. If you prefer social games, don’t worry; we have a 2V2 online team game option.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePvP mode filled with epic battles:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join players from all over the world who love battle games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Meet other players for short and crazy online PvP battles\\u003cbr\\u003e- Control your character in first person (FPS) or third person (TPS) games views\\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover the new 2v2 team mode! Cooperate with one of your friends or a random player to defeat the opponent team\\u003cbr\\u003e- 150+ unique weapons: try them all\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePersonalize your gameplay for 1v1 matches:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Switch between your 5 characters and gain the advantage\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose your strategy and lead your team to the victory\\u003cbr\\u003e- Being dead isn\\u0026#39;t that bad: revive instantly with another character and start over\\u003cbr\\u003e- Your battle team, your style: attack, defense, etc.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Adapt the weapon to the map and to your gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate your own FRAG team:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 150+ heroes for your dream team\\u003cbr\\u003e- Customize the skins and the power to make your hero the absolute champion\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play offline or online in the combat games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multiplayer is not a dream anymore, if you can play online, you can play with others\\u003cbr\\u003e- 5 heroes means 5 weapons, find the right balance between all\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTips\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Every character has its strengths and weaknesses: try them all to see which ones are best for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Both offline and online the heroes have the same powers!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Attack the enemy target to get lots of points, but beware of ambushes!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Check your missions for unique rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNew month, new hero, new meta:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- The same team can’t win forever\\u003cbr\\u003e- Nerf and buff custom-designed monthly to ensure an exciting meta\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn case you want to fire offline, don’t worry, Frag lets you fire offline as well!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFRAG has everything a shooter game needs: FPS and TPS options, auto fire, and all the controls are adjustable to fit your playing style!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us to get news and updates:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/FRAGTheGame/\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://twitter.com/FRAGTheGame\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.tiktok.com/@fragproshooter\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy: https://www.ohbibi.com/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.ohbibi.com/terms-services\"],\"Oh BiBi\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Bu0ReUdxmk7KXLE4jUJP4DF-wkXU6WT7kYJ1laP