9P92bzjidvtCBIEDuimhqxiaXIR2-FqCc_QQrM-RB2MZYSWhQm7c0c\"]]],\"FPS Strike Ops : Modern Arena\",[\"4.5\",4.520776],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ta.strike.ops\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ta.strike.ops\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ta.strike.ops\"]],[\"qgJcGloIIhIZChcKEWNvbS50YS5zdHJpa2Uub3BzEAEYA0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8JoBEwj3x4D+0NqXAxWIrgoJHe7WEyv6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAA\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"kAo4rc_GQg4\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kAo4rc_GQg4?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:kAo4rc_GQg4\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmAlWLtfmt9bfeHWTU4IxQRtpe8iGD_gBZ0AwzaNbDVXxKDL3SL_xFVAb_h8_yRE2K6yo6eA5JAo9TJ1u4rMcYh3BdLgbRUqJUNGSKYPNnLE5EDa6WmkBsUvhEQeRYIN54amu4SAskpPlXy3D3im4m3IC3Cl350vlKvpRbguPHAVVUeRH3gLC61SsmlwVv8rtiOuC-prPPLycnhyMLCacfYzHMR3XDb4EvCoK0Ko5XKJTZhVuUtoF8XLaPGUBkhq76BSOiZdDOF83DilsKqwSV4C7rkb3X4H00vB8gWkzozfA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kAo4rc_GQg4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eIf you like play Multiplayer (MP)  PvP Offline Shooter and to be a sniper. Here is for you, the latest of Team Deathmatch shooting game ! The combat is real, and you can be the hero. \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🔫Ready. Aim. Fire! \\u003c/b\\u003e This is the #1 realistic 3D team PvP game available on Google Play. You are a well trained elite member of special weapons and tactics teams. Equipped with sub-machine guns, sniper rifles and stun grenades, you will navigate secret missions across the globe to eradicate the evil syndicate that stands in the way of a peaceful world. It is time to load out your firearms! Leave no squad mate behind in this action oriented first person shooter game! Let the bullets fly now! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003d\\u003d\\u003dGame Features\\u003d\\u003d\\u003d\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Lots of perfect maps to get Best FPS Shooting Experience Ever.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ 20+ Weapons, Customize Your Exclusive Weapons and Skins! \\u003cbr\\u003e(MAC10,TMP,MP5,UMP, P90, Galil, FAMAS, AK47, M4A1,SG-552, AUG,M249-SAW,SG-550,AWP... )\\u003cbr\\u003e★Customize your weapon and get a unique skins to be cool Multiplayer FPS player.\\u003cbr\\u003e★Detailed Snipers for shooters who like to be a sniper.\\u003cbr\\u003e★Death Match: It\\u0026#39;s kill or be killed, is the way of the gun!.\\u003cbr\\u003e★Team Death Match: Team vs Team fight, who will be the last team standing on the arena?\\u003cbr\\u003e★Completely offline that you can play everywhere and any time\\u003cbr\\u003e★Perfect optimization even for weak devices!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAre you ready?\\u003c/b\\u003e Test out your shooting skills in this exciting fast-paced shooting game! Experience action, where fast reflexes and TACTICAL skills are essential to success. Be the best shooter in every beautifully crafted maps!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSUPPORT\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe\\u0026#39;re grateful for any and all feedback and suggestions on the project.😊😊\"],\"FPS Shooter \\u0026 Action Game\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F-PA6T3XIdvwrse23SaIC08Gy3t6F6Nx5tuza8AEM89mSB_3hZnRkP-4JMv6yjDGOiGDeAmq12oHYveiRbSdFw\"],null,[235,231,220,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dap