",4.319368],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003docean.nomad.survival.simulator\\u0026rdid\\u003docean.nomad.survival.simulator\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003docean.nomad.survival.simulator\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIJhImCiQKHm9jZWFuLm5vbWFkLnN1cnZpdmFsLnNpbXVsYXRvchABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],[[[null,null,\"oddj2-CR_ts\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oddj2-CR_ts?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:oddj2-CR_ts\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkiFK5_c9SM7Unh9JV6RD9een87oQ7VlMyfCy6oTAbhJF9waVBrzj5MBbVRV5J94_DSBaeveuS0UdUMbHCAWTTM0fwv_sFCXZb8Qmd2eSXDPX8Ut5by8HQb8MzXF8m7OXt40-ErHF-mApejTaHy62KwiEm6X07Kc6h3txmNs-HxOczH221H3dX8viMCu1XtTNCg8bMXetePxn3AdEKGbFCDN9g_uQIErTfGdRDzlNBAuY8P9EM6nah_qTyPjM99dfjQYSfU7WxByPCq_dmQJzLWRKGZbbNbiAdFucCBY5hjbw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oddj2-CR_ts/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to the raft, survivor! Ready to test your survival skills in the vast expanses of the ocean?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRaft Survival: Ocean Nomad – is an adventure survival game on a raft in the ocean. Fight enemies in the ocean, craft all kinds of items and weapons, explore new territories and uninhabited islands.\\u003cbr\\u003eMany adventures are waiting for you: survival on the island, exploration of the ocean by boat, fishing and much more. You will have to try hard to survive in the post-apocalypse: hunting for sharks and extracting resources from the ocean, building and improving the Raft and creating armor to protect against the dangers of the ocean.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures of our game:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Hundreds of weapons and items;\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Open world exploration;\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Realistic 3D HD - graphics;\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Survival on islands;\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Improved raft building.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTips for apocalypse survival:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌊 Catch items and resources with you hook\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChests and barrels floating around always contain vital resources for survival in the sea, and wreckages are really good material for raft building in ocean games. You might even find items, tools and weapons for defense of the raft, so keep on throwing the hook!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔫 Craft weapons and armor\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA prey can easily change the rules and become a hunter in shark games. Make a hard choice among hundreds of guns, two-handed blade weapons and armor parts to defend you floating base and hunt sharks. Craft a perfect arsenal and always be ready for the battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⛵️ Defend your raft\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBe ready to evolve and fight for survival in the sea with a double effort, now that you’ve got one more problem to deal with. No man can tame a shark and there’s nowhere to escape, so prepare for shooting and swinging all night and day long!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔨 Build and upgrade\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePay attention to the condition of your raft on the water in survival RPG games in the ocean. It’s not enough to tie together a couple of wooden planks without a roof or even walls to feel safe. Be creative and expand the raft in height and width, because the only limit for building in survival simulator games is your imagination. There’s also a lot of upgrades for fishing, storage space extension, that you can improve the floating shelter with to help you survive in the ocean.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e Explore the ocean\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHave you ever wondered if there is a lost land with forests, jungle and animals in this endless ocean? An awesome feature of our island survival games is now implemented in this one. Don’t sit idle — dare to explore the ocean and islands around. What do they hide: horror or glory, medieval royale treasures or wild tigers and scary dinosaurs from the jurassic age or even an old airplane wreckage? What\\u0026#39;s more you can find resources, upgrades for the raft and other items on the islands. You won’t need a ship or an ark to sail to them in shark games — a simple boat will do, and let the stars be your guide.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌋 Learn the story of the apocalypse\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAn unknown devastating cataclysm turned the world into an endless ocean and last survivors are locked on scattered islands like in prison, dreaming of finding their home. The quest of our raft game is to find them and discover the truth of what happened, find other people who could survive and join them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e Survive on a raft\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur offline survival simulator game is full of evolved enemies, good survival items and other features that will surprise everybody. Embark on an epic survival adventure with the Raft Survival: Ocean Nomad game. Play with no wifi or internet connection, last as many days as you can and share the results online with friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur company Survival Games LTD has full rights to use the RAFT trademark in the USA (The Mark Consists of Standard Characters without claim to any particular font style, size or color - Ser. No. 87-605,582 FILED 09-12-2017)\"],\"Survival Games Ltd\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/z4Vifd9QokHVoikfpWaTrcFyAD6DcmOAs2AoVJvHcHICDap5-boJcQQLln4WgbbXWEMpzrM92OeOx7D6_Vl_uA\"],null,[9,21,42,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003docean.nomad.survival.simulator\\u0026rdid\\u003docean.nomad.survival.simulator\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $129.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"com.football.soccer.league\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rNFwrxJdqCQrEHZl-UVcGNr4DilklPTXpAbad5KhXf4KEnP3-woFO_Iy2aSfamqH2aoT0Fu_t5A1TfD-0R__s-k\"],null,[244,244,245,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qb5BobfXrXIxLaQgQ3xahA7-EJcfXlN27Klk_nHq1OO2AXNy0RDf7XlPxNhHOBYeIgKFBd4qnWdjjaKF09-_D6Y\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zZjVpFTTSwvMWyzU83k1GJFCTjGBQtgsClogNKBtsYZAJv2bhcU_jMt16yRdd2kWqPD0ZVOJe13Ozsi08ji-sDg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ih0SKd7I0fn4VQ_qa6LVQC2K_HgLXIIVVVqgJAz7UGT4Oo9ep4qtMFTX_S9lFcGGT9aFW9FroyHzmUHkF80WiQ\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C5l9CXXh3FUu0c-629szbj7EJijpZEXp3jA4oV0LqeTBuDc5bKrwNH-e1bAlEnbG-4RJebvKE6F6AGM_ZrHIpA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GvEJUQayJqvBkxAbwV2hrujJJWgPIQXpvaevptaBHux-HPTdl8T1DhQH2SX9tJCZVV