v9WHrAKk3c-5oKDzgbpxT5hW8CezbwOp9f6nnmkOro30WoI6-c0bXWk52zlG2aOGzliDOfkOwGUK4A\"]]],\"Friday Night Funkin'\",[\"4.8\",4.8192196],\"Music\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dme.funkin.fnf\\u0026rdid\\u003dme.funkin.fnf\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dme.funkin.fnf\"]],[\"qgJYGlYIKBIVChMKDW1lLmZ1bmtpbi5mbmYQARgDShMI9Yyfy9HalwMVeQezBh0daiLwmgETCPfHgP7Q2pcDFYiuCgkd7tYTK/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"I12lovftsiw\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I12lovftsiw?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:I12lovftsiw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkffCbYkET3t9k5IS2ByfN7s8AYy8XduDpATswJ-0yccArEeoH7MwfKkf8Ba-WmehW1xN_B5iIDMZK0J9pcFTIIYJgTf00VIFabhuOoFK6ZF5UGll6GMQ_LN8oENYXs48wkjGEER58kg1_Mwal52iRpyyWXwiIne-Naa8epQlYVj6vC83lmXcxKK-cA5XWzuSRqQqlo88F6s4elO_hU1LdGwJ8Pl2IvGMwtvOTzDZDEPLEpf-pls-5POAJLg9KCoskXktQDLPqVg_aoJMblz6Dz7V8N_c23fWpvfffABLIRCA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/I12lovftsiw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Want to spend some time with your Girlfriend? Too bad, your rhythmic skills are being challenged by just about every nasty goon on planet earth. So you\\u0026#39;ll need to flex your skills and hit notes in time with the music, or the only place you\\u0026#39;ll be spending your friday is the hospital.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDADDY DON\\u0026#39;T PLAY NICE\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this story you play as BOYFRIEND who\\u0026#39;s trying to spend some time with no other than GIRLFRIEND. Bummer her evil, twisted freak of a father would sooner put you to rest than ever allow it. And it\\u0026#39;s not just him, go through the story and meet the many disturbed and backwards dopes who\\u0026#39;d try to stand in your way. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBANGIN\\u0026#39; SOUNDTRACK\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the music that\\u0026#39;s made waves online, and learn it to a T as you put your rhythm to the test hitting notes in time. Largely composed by KawaiSprite and Saruky, with industry talent collaborations like Lotus Juice of \\u0026#39;Persona 3\\u0026#39; fame and Kohta Takahashi of \\u0026#39;Ridge Racer 4\\u0026#39; fame. With over 60+ original songs currently in the game, there\\u0026#39;s plenty to master. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eINTERACTIVE CARTOON EXCELLENCE\\u003cbr\\u003eHand drawn, lovingly made 2D visuals. Every stage unique, every enemy special, and made right in Adobe Flash. The art and animations of PhantomArcade bring the Newgrounds spirit to phones in full force. And with more levels, cutscenes, and playable characters on the way... the amount of eye candy The Funkin\\u0026#39; Crew will bring has no end in sight.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe internet classic with 200+ million players is finally here on the Play Store, in its best form yet\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOther features include\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e+ Gameplay overseen by Tom Fulp\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e+ Code by Ninjamuffin99\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e+ Sky Mod (wait thats not in this)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e+ JohnnyUtah voice acting\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e+ Hot(?) characters!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e+ 18 years worth of gameplay\"],\"The Funkin' Crew Inc.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rZvhS-Zi71xVc8oXfBjY085341-5jEPSDr92EPpt4rlS_IKDDYC6o9qIEwRUoBsF6TmkCAJNSlxo57sxoGKKPA\"],null,[3,11,17,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSx