J3QbcZ3poAol_-deOFu-K9Fa5ppIr4rVimRIuq4kQ\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kz_IYYIGQsxfhTETwgGAG7yNTROk-GRjJ9RSHfWMV_GRILav_BzoR4iiq7rO1w02r-gwW-svWSGbct0QRiAb\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Jyy6cDMK0ANLYDivFUVwsoa2Nu0Ul9xYFBc-JIexThUpE0fcerc4m-9HmzPRu1trI1OGWvf74KFC8UvhP0ub\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CvKZqrn-IjhHps_WdrtVf9tC6qwls70Y9enE8WFWqIf8sPsE9jpHY5ifK_DKl2GbJzUvhyHq2a9YxU5nyYRYsVg\"]]],\"Design Home™: House Makeover\",[\"4.3\",4.326595],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.crowdstar.covetHome\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.crowdstar.covetHome\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.crowdstar.covetHome\"]],[\"qgJqGmgILBIfCh0KF2NvbS5jcm93ZHN0YXIuY292ZXRIb21lEAEYA0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8JoBEwj3x4D+0NqXAxWIrgoJHe7WEyv6ARcKFQi/97uR3q/riEMSCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"gTS_PROadag\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gTS_PROadag?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:gTS_PROadag\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznPQn_D6Rytu3wds9RlWeYM9PKPQN63Mf_y_LuwvOBCcoYhVzWD510jJL_V15QhSvczCNJImn31jjFXJNxwQF0w-Qa7CGgMTPFn9CEQDu0gm5IT6XbXCyHR6O3CwSaDhJ99OmdCVgvMKmvNbw2AojRbX7swQ5vLi6QwT38gRZGPDckkjggwCSPkJjSqtZ7qQptpV-RWVPQNQZ451GgJqa1ZnYVQp6IryhzBvXdZnpolFdtSmTVGrBUAl6EcVByTP_WmJXCVcuXh1GtECjeOp-_Wa2DqV31iu_M9gdrCVSBAiA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gTS_PROadag/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShow off your home decorating \\u0026amp; designing skills with Design Home. Master interior design to remodel \\u0026amp; decorate your dream rooms and houses. Make Design Home your escape into room and garden design – with chic home decor brands and a realistic interior design experience. Design Home is the hit interior design game where your dream house comes to life with endless home makeover \\u0026amp; decor options. Build, style, decorate, progress through the ranks, and design the home interiors you’ve always dreamed of!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour dream house design is at your fingertips, with challenges that let you test your interior design skills and bring you closer to mastery. Take on exciting exterior design challenges to showcase your garden design know-how! Get creative with hundreds of home décor items and furniture from top brands like Room \\u0026amp; Board, Williams Sonoma, and Lulu \\u0026amp; Georgia. Design Home makes any home possible, bringing your home decor \\u0026amp; interior design dreams to life!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBECOME THE ULTIMATE INTERIOR DESIGNER\\u003cbr\\u003e- Renovate, remodel, design \\u0026amp; decorate kitchens, bedrooms, \\u0026amp; bathrooms – you name it. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Kitchen design, bedroom design, bathroom design – take charge of each renovation and earn rewards as you bring rooms to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Experience decorating games in a whole new way with immersive 3D rooms and realistic furnishings. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover the home décor game that lets you test your decision-making and helps you grow your design skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e3D SIMULATION GAMES MEET REAL-LIFE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Create your dream room designs with furniture and décor from over 60 top brands and designers.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Decorate with favorites like Room \\u0026amp; Board, Williams Sonoma, Lulu \\u0026amp; Georgia, and more leading furniture brands.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stay inspired with monthly trend spotlights featuring the latest home décor styles and professional design tips.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Interior Designer Voices – explore exclusive home decor, design challenges, and decorating games with well-known designers.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Remodel, renovate \\u0026amp; challenge yourself with this month’s latest exterior \\u0026amp; interior design trends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR DREAM HOUSE DESIGN\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dinnerware, flatware, centerpieces, and now introducing accent walls and throw blankets.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Test your home design \\u0026amp; home decor skills with tablescaping challenges every Tuesday.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Progress faster with Design Pass to earn diamonds and exclusive rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Take on weekly Exterior Design challenges with unique garden décor and prizes.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Build your dream house with pets! Add cats, dogs, fish, birds, and MORE.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFind us!\\u003cbr\\u003eFriend Us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/gaming/DesignHomeGame\\u003cbr\\u003eDouble Tap us on Instagram: @designhome\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch Us on TikTok: @designhome\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app: Requires acceptance of EA’s Privacy \\u0026amp; Cookie Policy and User Agreement. Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Includes in-game advertising. Collects data through third-party ad-serving and analytics technology (See Privacy \\u0026amp; Cookie Policy for details). Allows players to communicate. Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. Includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUser Agreement: terms.ea.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo Not Sell My Personal Information: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACYCA/US/en/PC/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEA may retire online features after 30 days’ notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the ultimate design challenge with Design Home– the immersive decorating game where you can showcase your interior design skills. Compete, create, and progress as you bring your vision to life with décor from real brands. Build your style, personalize every space, and renovate stunning rooms by completing exciting home design challenges.\"],\"Crowdstar Inc\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xxZ03pYe8fbcQXf11zoqR8oonJQLcrG5zbsFWXy2xC_Edr1Up1JqoDn-nor5PMI-LJYF2JzwV6XPsyhgn3QkcA\"],null,[157,154,151,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, Shares Location, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.crowdstar.covetHome\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.crowdstar.covetHome\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $199.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"net.apex_designs.payback2\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pgIYTa6ICMwX6ydeHQ1kObHoJd652jYXyHHna0g6HJRbYtSHa8uP5zWSbz8i2t18Sb99hSGuR9iDUurmKGAL31I\"],null,[64,48,22,255],null,null,null,2],[[