TMhU7lgKZWi-Ocakw0zD5lt6Yg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DlJ8TwRBN6-tC6U3NdBPX8Nzm-980xmfA_9JzSaLafkvkzxrxDbXIb9qyuRqqyTaTl4XMaGHFMWvIsOAoCcA9g\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dvbfjcQN2D340AGTlkoehDeRsl94T2rRz9NaQ_ENYxr26fxjz0E1NHR7TdL22BpJiCc6FF2Igx1JlxYh6u8-lA\"]]],\"House Designer : Fix \\u0026 Flip\",[\"4.6\",4.590443],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.kgs.housedesigner\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.kgs.housedesigner\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.kgs.housedesigner\"]],[\"qgJgGl4ILxIdChsKFWNvbS5rZ3MuaG91c2VkZXNpZ25lchABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],null,[null,\"Play House Designer : Fix and Flip today - a fun simulator game of house renovation where you can realize all your home design fantasies into reality. Try yourself in the role of house flipper.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  Interior designer\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you like interior design? \\u003cbr\\u003eIn House Designer you can buy a house and do experiments with home design and express your creativity in it. There is a lot of selection of house furniture, beds, chairs, tables, bath and kitchen furniture, painting and other decor items.\\u003cbr\\u003eUpgrade your skills and polish your amazing abilities as an interior decorator.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  In House Designer you can find yourself as a Garden designer.\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate harmony and beauty on your backyard in combination with the comfort of the placed decor items and furniture on your garden.\\u003cbr\\u003eCare for your grass using a grass-cutter and a rake.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlant flowers and put garden beds with exotic plants in your garden.\\u003cbr\\u003eInstall a pergola, place comfortable chairs in it, or lay tiles around the pool area and place the sun beds. It all depends on you. Plan the whole garden according to your imagination.\\u003cbr\\u003eBackyard design is able to make your garden cozy, beautiful, and most importantly - original and unique.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  Buy, Fix \\u0026amp; Flip\\u003cbr\\u003eBuy devastated houses, repair them and upgrade their design. Give them a second life and live in them or sell with profit. Earn a fortune in house flipping.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e  Renovate work\\u003cbr\\u003ePerform tasks for cleaning and designing houses and other interesting locations. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload House Designer: Fix and flip and become the best house flipper and designer of the county! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can always write on e-mail of our studio about your problem and we will certainly consider your application.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMail for communication: karategoosestudio@gmail.com\"],\"TURBOGOOSE GAMES\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Mx1tN5yf6Dsv9bdKsdzbR-iFZPXiZFDdoXyEktdXrYwmR_OPmYOOpoFYUt6Xs99OovNoKL0Zp19ZbT7Syz9GZcI\"],null,[50,52,26,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[nul