ity Wars: Vice World 3d\",[\"3.8\",3.848856],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dblock.app.wars\\u0026rdid\\u003dblock.app.wars\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dblock.app.wars\"]],[\"qgJZGlcIMBIWChQKDmJsb2NrLmFwcC53YXJzEAEYA0oTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8JoBEwj3x4D+0NqXAxWIrgoJHe7WEyv6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAA\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"EtpP2uxN2tU\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EtpP2uxN2tU?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:EtpP2uxN2tU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkiBCxG_Mlkmbf0VlfDu3KmsXpNitk_gLbmtyQFzz1wRRyAzXZJ3C2C6Nw-EESSIewgQS7-GRf96txIspjqPa31u_38WsHwD_9ZDdQ1np-OwV-AeC53-Tm8XLpIhwXO5-HSAbO-89vqZ6SH1UJfn62urguCvdmfL8mwSxXAC3mVPlp97pWCSZGHlwmyI6mcS-YomCYeRP1JFm8XY3lN_NOwgQRWgjPJh5XB0Apu5N8X-MDOK8HvzVxj30AsXHmcZ0_Q-8wzLAa0Q0kRz1yi6PZaTXYztloy-5Xudb2bRNweoA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EtpP2uxN2tU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to the Mafia World of Block City Wars! It\\u0026#39;s a modern blocky arena where fast cars, sniper duels, and wild bandit fights are the norms. Enjoy one of the best car shooting games out there! Keep your eyes peeled; shootings are rampant, and the streets nearly lawless. Discover a lot of intriguing missions involving gangsters and cops, gangs, mafia, and police. Race to outsmart other hunters for coins, weapons, and ammo scattered throughout.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreative ways of fun and action - that block city might need a little destruction to shake things up. For fans of intense 3D battlegrounds, we’ve packed in everything: plasma guns, destroyers, super rifles, various armor types, and many more exhilarating items for you to discover!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAccomplish impossible ops where you\\u0026#39;re the key to achieving critical goals. Drive awesome cars and escape from rival gangs. Whether you choose to be a hero or a bad guy, adventures are waiting at every corner. Arm yourself with your pixel gun and head into the Block City!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to 3d shooter - Block City Wars:\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ 1,000,000+ players worldwide for thrilling online gaming!\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ A vast open world with towering skyscrapers where you are free to do whatever you wish.\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Cool multiplayer Free PVP Fight mode and a captivating single-player Campaign.\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ More than 20 modes of transport, including sports cars, motorcycles, jet packs, zip lines, and gliders – all customizable\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Arm yourself for combat with over 30 weapon units – from the AK47 and MINIGUN to sniper rifles, RPGs, Katanas, and many more!\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Wide range of mods to upgrade your guns: silencers, extended magazines, improved sights, stocks, and much more!\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Full game stats and daily winners lists.\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ A community of more than 150,000 players online every day.\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Game chat to communicate with fellow players.\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Awesome pixel graphics with dynamic lighting.\\u003cbr\\u003e⊹ Endless character customization possibilities, featuring various skins and cosmetics.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDon’t miss out on this fun car shooting game! Enter the amazing blocky world of Block City Wars and become a survivor in a city controlled by the mafia!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us on social media:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/bcw3D\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/blockcitywars2\\u003cbr\\u003eInsta: https://www.instagram.com/bcw_pg/\"],\"Kadexo Limited\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pBCbn4-4GTaurxkUBRzWRPWzaCKZl43DapaLn8zT9JKgrlCaAGsXx4y2Ci-NDUQ0neXPbIRzyOaJFxpFw_tp\"],null,[184,208,233,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact, Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dblock.app.wars\\u0026rdid\\u003dblock.app.wars\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $109.99 per item\",[false]]],[[\"com.bethsoft.falloutshelter\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BhFGuKW4pv-43oWXky2QKSsd5Vl-bxx5JSvZ2lEmKpK4Q8uNwoI9mXcCG2LInBtSFj03LLLYcPJyhtuouOjZKA\"],null,[1,40,103,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1320,2868],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fg00d_UbMj9XAHL9GlDgNcJjImArn5HA90-0O_FBP4DyHMhR54FYG8B-zfjAhlYgzSeEgD6jFuOQtH5l9T_e4w\"]],[null,2,[1320,2868],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W_WY72NAcuXf6r3-31RsGT-vw61mKziE_A5C8afpmQHySth0fDyUeJriKgRp3ZxuzNHbX1v21RgaK5sDSLSL\"]],[null,2,[1320,2868],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h6C5W6Eym6wJj52RczupZcGxho5og_1sdZiy1LIAXLEgPqc54fWYrBfaJ6j6E44naMIiJp0qS12jii5gGVtUFw\"]],[null,2,[1320,2868],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/brYHBtDhymEOFOlie933HN0Xyjnv4ulYsulivICosZMTFI_mTWPfqYF