ull,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vZgNd3dOKYqOSHBNiXkzoSMPtJPhacVFUC1UFFXyKyOG_7t1Bp8VoZpY22uS5YC0mgiD_UfozIeGmsSmOWMp6w\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EoQ-ccn-SAUl7nHQk-1fqLXkjjv5tb_O4qhSgO1GCVFVVG3vJvernltbAn9Q5cuofcXdsqMPw456ZcQnv-I\"]]],\"Fallout Shelter\",[\"4.6\",4.5821114],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bethsoft.falloutshelter\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bethsoft.falloutshelter\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bethsoft.falloutshelter\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIMRIjCiEKG2NvbS5iZXRoc29mdC5mYWxsb3V0c2hlbHRlchABGANKEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCaARMI98eA/tDalwMViK4KCR3u1hMr+gEPCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAA\"],[[[null,null,\"HY4jCjufLG8\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HY4jCjufLG8?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:HY4jCjufLG8\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznOKEQv5iY7_4_n9tMZ7EVGIYcqTGRthLgRUML5CAEwebedsRhJn0-P0oojMfLDtFyzjoehNjwPfMZLgvaZqHMAr_E-nJB7gcZvxz1z4zgAbUFnC5xvfCzOz-HBFEDSZd-sKPweduzn13z2KEgmnIWUImErxgEk5sc7fJGxMe75t9kviieKuRg45Ku_RPaR_fdI6F_q5irP2ORtOGRKs80mkYfAZw0u5jJrIUD8h1PIDumLvEO-vy0uU3OiYPpxRIxp6BzyGD7rwDtCe1DMW2B_bI45v9tRyeA946La8RH5dg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HY4jCjufLG8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Create a brighter future…underground! Take on your role as Overseer in a base building survival game from the Fallout franchise. Build a base and create the perfect post-apocalyptic vault under 2,000 feet of bedrock. Manage your Dwellers, explore the hostile Wasteland, and survive against radioactive threats. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eLead Dwellers on the quest to true happiness as you progress in your underground excavation. Outfit Dwellers with specialized gear, help them find ideal jobs, and train them to improve S.P.E.C.I.A.L. abilities. Play matchmaker to repopulate your base. Oversee your thriving community and protect your Dwellers from danger. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eSend Dwellers on Wasteland quests to explore the blasted surface left behind. Find adventure, search for life above, survive dangers, and collect loot to take back to your vault. Build a base and battle hazardous threats in a post-apocalypse survival game that puts you to the test. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock new shelter Seasons featuring limited-time vaults! Master base building with experimental vaults that are separate from your main vault, for a chance to win Season-specific, in-game rewards. Oversee post-apocalyptic survival in brand-new themed locations! \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eDive into the Fallout universe, create your perfect vault, and embark on an underground adventure in this offline base building game. Post-apocalyptic world building is in your hands!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eFALLOUT SHELTER FEATURES \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eUNDERGROUND BASE BUILDER \\u003cbr\\u003e- Build a brighter future and survive an epic underground game! You\\u0026#39;re in control of a state-of-the-art Vault from Vault-Tec. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Expand your Vault in a post-apocalypse, building survival game! Turn an excavation beneath 2,000 feet of bedrock into the very picture of underground Vault Life. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Construct a variety of specialized rooms in a creative base and world building game. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Build a Radio Room to recruit new Dwellers or play matchmaker to repopulate. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003ePOST-APOCALYPSE WORLD BUILDING \\u0026amp; SURVIVAL RPG \\u003cbr\\u003e- Get to know your Dwellers and lead them to happiness in a post-apocalyptic simulation. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Find their ideal jobs and watch them flourish.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Provide Dwellers with outfits, weapons, and training to improve S.P.E.C.I.A.L. abilities. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Increase S.P.E.C.I.A.L. stats and improve your Dwellers\\u0026#39; chance of Wasteland survival \\u003cbr\\u003e- Customize the look of any Dweller in the Barbershop. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Build a base and gear up to battle threats from the outside…and within. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eWASTELAND EXPLORATION \\u0026amp; DANGEROUS QUESTS\\u003cbr\\u003e- Send Dwellers on quests above ground and uncover new areas beyond your underground excavation\\u003cbr\\u003e- Survive the Wasteland to find new armor and weapons, gain experience, and earn Caps.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Encounter new Dwellers in the Wasteland to bring back to your vault.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Survive missions to earn handy survival loot, or fail and meet unspeakable death…\\u003cbr\\u003e- Open lunchboxes for a chance to collect Legendary Dwellers, including Lucy MacLean, Sarah Lyons, and Abraham Washington. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eSurvive life in a post-apocalyptic world through this free-to-play base building and management simulation game. Vault-Tec has provided the tools, but the rest is up to you. What are you waiting for? Take on a massive excavation in this epic Fallout base builder and underground game!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e** Google Play Best of 2015 ** \\u003cbr\\u003eMobile Game of the Year – 2016 DICE Awards \\u003cbr\\u003eWinner 2015 Golden Joystick Best Handheld/Mobile Game \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Might just be the best free-to-play game out there\\u0026quot; – GamesBeat \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Probably the best game of E3 2015\\u0026quot; – Gizmodo\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026quot;Fallout Shelter is simple to play and addictive as hell.\\u0026quot; – GameZone\"],\"Bethesda Softworks LLC\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c1KzKrrhdnkCyeK4e7Q1LL-hnZgme7LxUiaiv2vYqGb_H0QEjOe194J33t6XZkBlNUpvc0vbCu_l10FujzHCWg\"],null,[18,16,15,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Alcohol Reference, Mild Violence, Suggestive Themes\"],[null,\"Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bethsoft.falloutshelter\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bethsoft.falloutshelter\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]]],[\"Similar apps\",null,[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/collection/cluster?gsr\\u003dOhMKCwoJbWluZWNyYWZ0EAAYBCACSjDCAi0KGgoWY29tLm1vamFuZy5taW5lY3JhZnRwZRAHGAoiDQoJbWluZWNyYWZ0EAA%3D:S:ANO1ljK0UsI\"]],[null,\"IAJid0pDCj0INBCaisKuChC1yZrkAhCWjJTGDxCtvbyLDRDxtYvvDRCrgaL9BhCj0_DzCRDO99-NCxDh3NWMDxDek8YpQgIICVAywgItChoKFmNvbS5tb2phbmcubWluZWNyYWZ0cGUQBxgKIg0KCW1pbmVjcmFmdBAA\"]]]],[null,null,null,[\"qgI/Ej0QA6IBEwj1jJ/L0dqXAxV5B7MGHR1qIvCyAiIKIAoaYXBwc19yZWxhdGVkX3F1ZXJ5X2NsdXN0ZXIQLRgD\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[\"minecraft 2\",[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/search?q\\u003dminecraft+2\\u0026c\\u003dapps\"]],[\"qgI8GjoIAEoTCPWMn8vR2pcDFXkHswYdHWoi8IoBIAoRCgttaW5lY3JhZnQgMhA1GAMSC21pbmVjcmFmdCAy\"]],[\"minecraft pe\",[null,null,null,null,[null,nu